ons: The Greats on Camera 2011” mirror the rhythms and aesthetics of the art itself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/01/nyregion/jazz-films-at-jacob-burns-center-evoke-the-music.html', 'snippet': 'Documentaries by Paul Bernays and Oren Jacoby featured in the series “Jazz Sessions: The Greats on Camera 2011” mirror the rhythms and aesthetics of the art itself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAN one art form evoke another? The filmmakers Paul Bernays and Oren Jacoby think so. Working independently, some 15 years apart, each made a documentary about jazz that he hoped would mirror the music itself. The films will be shown at “Jazz Sessions: The Greats on Camera 2011” at the Jacob Burns Film Center  in Pleasantville.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/01/nyregion/01FILMWE-1/01FILMWE-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/01/nyregion/01FILMWE-1/01FILMWE-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/01/nyregion/01FILMWE-1/01FILMWE-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Evoking Jazz, Through Film', 'kicker': 'Arts | Westchester', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Evoking Jazz, Through Film', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Burns, Jacob, Film Center', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-0