ile!”)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '7 Tips for Great Wedding Pictures', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-01T10:23:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roy Furchgott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Furchgott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d491174-2a07-514e-8507-fd61b07b1c37', 'word_count': 1023, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d491174-2a07-514e-8507-fd61b07b1c37'}, {'abstract': 'The Jets focused on defensive linemen in the early rounds of the draft, but turned their attention to offense Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/01/jets-picks-in-2011-n-f-l-draft/', 'snippet': 'The Jets focused on defensive linemen in the early rounds of the draft, but turned their attention to offense Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Jets focused on defensive linemen in the early rounds of the draft, but turned their attention to offense Saturday, including trading up in the fifth round to get T.C.U. receiver Jeremy Kerley. Their last two picks, Greg McElroy and Scotty McKnight, have known Mark Sanchez for years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jets’ Picks in 2011 N.F.L. Draft', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-01T10:30:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'n