s, but Big News Was Buzzing in the Crowd', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Philadelphia Phillies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wright, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-02T06:15:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/69057e9d-23a7-5fff-af6a-6fa1d1fe3de7', 'word_count': 1095, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69057e9d-23a7-5fff-af6a-6fa1d1fe3de7'}, {'abstract': 'About how many World of Warcraft gamers are adult men?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/02/test-yourself-math-may-2-2011/', 'snippet': 'About how many World of Warcraft gamers are adult men?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Test your math skills with today’s question, created by Kari Kokka at Math for America from the article “It’s Love at First Kill.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Test Yourself | Math, May 2, 2011', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-02T06:24:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/28081e0f-f7a1-5065-a98b-c0c58b7ca9b0', 'word_count': 50, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28081e0f-f7a1-5065-a98b-c0c58b7ca9b0'}, {'abstract': 'Despite the enormous