 basement, the WestFest Dance Festival animated the nooks and crannies of the Westbeth Center for the Arts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/arts/dance/westfest-dance-festival-animates-westbeth-review.html', 'snippet': 'From rooftop to basement, the WestFest Dance Festival animated the nooks and crannies of the Westbeth Center for the Arts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many a performance begins with an announcement pointing out service information, like the location of the fire exits, should people need to leave in a hurry. But the statement issued on Sunday afternoon by Pascal Rekoert, at the WestFest Dance Festival, was a first: “Please do not leave your group. You will get lost, and you will never get out of Westbeth.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/03/arts/jp-westfest/jp-westfest-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 329, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/03/arts/jp-westfest/jp-westfest-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 329}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/03/arts/jp-westfest/jp-westfest-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/03/arts/jp-westfest/jp-westfest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/03/arts/jp-westfest/jp-westfest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Square Feet and Human Feet: Making a Building Move to the Music', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Square Feet and Human Feet: