nce', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Jolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jolly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/036e6016-1bb2-59be-8b93-669cbe9d733b', 'word_count': 484, 'uri': 'nyt://article/036e6016-1bb2-59be-8b93-669cbe9d733b'}, {'abstract': 'Bin Laden’s death prompts worldwide travel alert, figuring life expectancy with online calculators, grape tomatoes recalled for salmonella risk and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/tuesday-reading-bin-ladens-death-spurs-worldwide-travel-alert/', 'snippet': 'Bin Laden’s death prompts worldwide travel alert, figuring life expectancy with online calculators, grape tomatoes recalled for salmonella risk and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A variety of consumer-focused articles appears daily in The New York Times and online in our blogs. Each weekday morning, we gather them together here so you can quickly scan the news that could hit your wallet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tuesday Reading: Bin Laden’s Death Spurs Worldwide Travel Alert', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-03T12:22:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a3d1f36-430c-5c30-a2bb-f88fec84cd74', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a3d1f36-430c-5c30-a2bb-f88fec84cd74'}, {'abstract': 'On Tuesday, The Lede continues to follow the global reaction to the killing of Osama bin Laden during an American raid in Pakistan on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/latest-updates-on-the-death-of-bin-laden/', 'snippet': 'On Tuesday, The Lede continues to follow the global reaction to the killing of Osama bin Laden during an American raid in Pakistan on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday, The Lede continues to follow the global reaction to the killing of Osama bin Laden during an American raid in Pakistan early on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Updates on the Death of Bin Laden, May 3', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-03T12:43:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/a06e2c93-c7fe-5e1d-ab05-709624d3c2c5', 'word_count': 3435, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a06e2c93-c7fe-5e1d-ab05-709624d3c2c5'}, {'abstract': 'The sale of the plastics equipment maker will give Onex, the largest Canadian private equity firm, total net proceeds of $1.8 billion.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/onex-sells-husky-international-for-2-1-billion/', 'snippet': 'The sale of the plastics equipment maker will give Onex, the largest Canadian private equity firm, total net proceeds of $1.8 billion.