/cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/students-take-time-to-reflect-on-bin-laden/', 'snippet': 'In the Schools: The death of Osama bin Laden prompts a spirited and high-minded discussion in one classroom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Matt Polazzo, a teacher at Stuyvesant High School in Lower Manhattan, put aside his planned lesson on Nigerian politics on Monday to ask what his students thought about the demise of Osama bin Laden, who was killed the day before by American soldiers in Pakistan. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Students Take Time to Reflect on Bin Laden', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Polazzo, Matt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stuyvesant High School', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-03T15:45:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sharon Otterman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sharon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Otterman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4ab55a8-1145-57a5-bf70-2ecc8d9049a3', 'word_count': 1033, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4ab55a8-1145-57a5-bf70-2ecc8d9049a3'}, {'abstract': 'As a counterpoint to my weekly carping, here’s my latest small sampling of sparkling prose from recent editions. (Feel free to use the comments section to point out your own recent favorites.)', 'web_url': 'https://afterdeadline.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/bright-passages-7/', 'snippet': 'As a counterpoint to my weekly carping, here’s my latest small sampling of sparkling prose from recent editions. (Feel free to use the comments section to point out your own recent favorites.)', 'lead_paragraph':