ation': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/95d05691-c41c-576a-95bb-48287e1b0d8a', 'word_count': 1657, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95d05691-c41c-576a-95bb-48287e1b0d8a'}, {'abstract': 'Well, that was embarrassing. A photograph that accompanied my article on the Met gala in this morning’s paper was accompanied by an erroneous caption that identified the designer Oscar de la Renta as Giorgio Armani.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/oscar-de-la-renta-hey-thats-me/', 'snippet': 'Well, that was embarrassing. A photograph that accompanied my article on the Met gala in this morning’s paper was accompanied by an erroneous caption that identified the designer Oscar de la Renta as Giorgio Armani.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Well, that was embarrassing. A photograph that accompanied my article on the Met gala in Tuesday morning’s paper was accompanied by an erroneous caption that identified the designer Oscar de la Renta as Giorgio Armani. (For what it’s worth, I don’t write the captions.) Mr. Armani wasn’t even at the party.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oscar de la Renta: Hey, That’s Me!', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-03T15:50:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/53dc1a10-69cf-517f-964c-fe38338cd330', 'word_count': 216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53dc1a10-69cf-517f-964c-fe38338cd330'}, {'abstract': 'A California appeals court rejected the argument that other women who said Phil Spector had threatened them with guns should not have been allowed to testify in the case.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/court-denies-appeal-of-spector-murder-conviction/', 'snippet': 'A California appeals court rejected the argument that other women who said Phil Spector had threatened them with guns should not have been allowed to testify in the case.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A California appeals court has turned down an appeal by Phil Spector to have his murder conviction overturned and rejected the argument that other women who said he had threatened them with guns should not have been allowed to testify in the case, The Associated Press reported.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Court Denies Appeal of Spector Murder Conviction', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clarkson, Lana', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spector, Phil', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-03T15:53:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a3dcfc0-4954-5958-838c-4d5d76dbeb23', 'word_count': 280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a3dcfc0-4954-5958-838c-4d5d76dbeb23'}, {'abstract': 'Col. René Emilio Ponce led a military accused of atrocities during El Salvador’s civil war.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/04/world/americas/04ponce.html', 'snippet': 'Col. René Emilio Ponce led a military accused of atrocities during El Salvador’s civil war.', 'lead_paragraph': 'René Emilio Ponce, a Salvadoran military leader accused of ordering one of the most shocking atrocities of El Salvador’s civil war, the killing of six Jesuit priests in 1989, died on Monday at a military hospital in San Salvador. He was 64.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/world/PONCE-obit/PONCE-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 708, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/world/PONCE-obit/PONCE-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/05/world/PONCE-obit/PONCE-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'René Emilio Ponce, El Salvador General Linked to Priests’ Murders, Dies at 64', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'R. E. Ponce, 64, Dies, Tied to Salvador Priest Killings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-03T15:54:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Grimes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grimes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/34615ff1-d0c6-5348-9199-48b1fb076374', 'word_count': 816, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34615ff1-d0c6-5348-9199-48b1fb076374'}, {'abstract': 'Scientists in Barrow, Alaska, use three methods to estimate the population of bowhead whales: an ice-edge based count, passive acoustic monitoring and photographic capture-recapture.', 'web_url': 'https://scientistatwork.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/three-ways-to-count-whales/', 'snippet': 'Scientists in Barrow, Alaska, use three methods to estimate the population of bowhead whales: an ice-edge based count, passive acoustic monitoring and photographic capture-recapture.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Kate Stafford, an oceanographer at the Applied Physics Laboratory at the University of Washington, writes from Alaska, where she is participating in a visual census of bowhead whales.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Three Ways to Count Whales', 'kicker': 'Scientist at Work', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Whales and Whaling', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stafford, Kate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-03T16:02:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Stafford', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stafford', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6eddcef-26db-55b0-8c33-94c0673766a4', 'word_count': 887, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6eddcef-26db-55b0-8c33-94c0673766a4'}, {'abstract': 'The Kentucky Derby Morning Line for Tuesday, May 3.', 'web_url': 'https://therail.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/03/morning-line-hedging-bets-at-the-derby/', 'snippet': 'The Kentucky Derby Morning Line for Tuesday, May 3.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Much like the public handicappers, the sports media Tuesday was unable to settle upon a favorite among the horses to cover in the Kentucky Derby. Instead the coverage was spread out among nearly all t