’s worth reviewing the prime sources of vulnerability behind the terrible death counts: the substantial growth in southern populations in recent decades, a dearth of basements and the enduring popularity of mobile homes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Tornado Zones, Seeking Shelter From the Storm', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tornadoes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mann, Michael E', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN METEOROLOGICAL SOCIETY', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Center for Atmospheric Research', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Tech University', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oklahoma', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Southern States (US)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-03T20:36:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/9901e894-9f6f-5ccf-be86-c345143e025d', 'word_count': 1779, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9901e894-9f6f-5ccf-be86-c345143e025d'}, {'abstract': 'Jennifer Johnson Cano, mezzo-soprano, makes her New York recital debut at Merkin Concert Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/04/arts/music/jennifer-johnson-cano-in-debut-at-merkin-hall-review.html', 'snippet': 'Jennifer Johnson Cano, mezzo-soprano, makes her New Yo