sh herb grower and expert, evokes spring from cover to cover.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/04/dining/04herb.html', 'snippet': '“Jekka’s Herb Cookbook,” by an English herb grower and expert, evokes spring from cover to cover.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No cookbook is easier to organize than one about herbs. Arrange it alphabetically, add some recipes that can be grouped in an index listing, and you are home free. That’s what Jekka McVicar, an English herb grower and expert, has done in this alluring volume, for Mother’s Day perhaps. The book evokes spring from cover to cover, with illustrations by Ms. McVicar’s daughter, Hannah, that suggest William Morris patterns.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/04/dining/04stuffbooks/04stuffbook-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 810, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/04/dining/04stuffbooks/04stuffbook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/04/dining/04stuffbooks/04stuffbook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Cookbook Devoted to Herbs', 'kicker': 'Food Stuff', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Herbs, Cover to Cover', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Herbs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-03T22:23:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualif