iants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/04/sports/baseball/04vecsey.html', 'snippet': 'In a tasteful gesture to American troops in the wake of the mission against Osama bin Laden on Sunday night, the Mets’ invited military personnel to see Tuesday’s game against the Giants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fastest feet in the ballpark Tuesday night did not belong to Jose Reyes, who was on base all six times, but rather to Steve Castleton, a volunteer with the U.S.O., distributing tickets to service members. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/04/sports/VECSEY/VECSEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/04/sports/VECSEY/VECSEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/04/sports/VECSEY/VECSEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/04/sports/VECSEY/VECSEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/04/sports/VECSEY/VECSEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets Thank Troops in a Meaningful Setting', 'kicker': 'Sports of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mets Thank Troops In a Meaningful Setting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Mili