id, with owners choosing to hold back their best properties.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/04/nyregion/44-works-sell-for-170-million-at-sothebys-auction.html', 'snippet': 'While a Picasso painting sold for $21.3 million, the overall sale was tepid, with owners choosing to hold back their best properties.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chinese and Russian could be heard in the Sotheby’s salesroom on Tuesday night at the beginning of the big spring auction season. But in spite of the presence of Prada-clad international collectors, it was a tepid start, with a few strong prices and many works selling below expectations. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/04/nyregion/AUCTION/AUCTION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 805, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/04/nyregion/AUCTION/AUCTION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/04/nyregion/AUCTION/AUCTION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '44 Works Sell for $170 Million at Sotheby’s Auction', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '44 Works Sell for $170 Million at Sotheby’s Auction', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sotheby's", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-04T03:26:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname'