malfunction of the plane’s airspeed sensors. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Voice Recorder From Air France Plane Crash Is Found', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | EUROPE', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Voice Recorder From Air France Plane Crash Is Found', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AIR FRANCE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-04T04:51:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicola Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicola', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec0368ec-b789-56c3-a678-b980f4410e0e', 'word_count': 109, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec0368ec-b789-56c3-a678-b980f4410e0e'}, {'abstract': "A drought in the Oklahoma Panhandle is poised to do what the Dust Bowl couldn't — drive towns in this parched region out of existence.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/100000000802793/the-dry-season.html', 'snippet': "A drought in the Oklahoma Panhandle is poised to do what the Dust Bowl couldn't — drive towns in this parched region out of existence.", 'lead_paragraph': "A drought in the Oklahoma Panhandle is poised to do what the Dust Bowl couldn't — drive towns in this parched region out of existence.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/04/us/video-oklahoma/video-oklahoma-articleLarge.jpg', '