uring an American raid in Pakistan this week, The Lede provides updates on breaking news and charts the global reaction. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Updates on the Killing of Bin Laden, May 4', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Abbottabad (Pakistan)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-04T13:10:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6aa3a86-0ffb-5964-be90-95a1640bda1f', 'word_count': 3892, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6aa3a86-0ffb-5964-be90-95a1640bda1f'}, {'abstract': 'Stocks fell Wednesday, with commodity producers driving a third straight loss for the Standard & Poor’s 500-stock index.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/05/business/05markets.html', 'snippet': 'Stocks fell Wednesday, with commodity producers driving a third straight loss for the Standard & Poor’s 500-stock index.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stocks fell Wednesday, with commodity producers driving a third straight loss for the Standard & Poor’s 500-stock index, as lower-than-estimated reports on service industries and job growth damped optimism in the economy.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headlin