be6-53a8-9a0f-95a141cadadd'}, {'abstract': 'Fewer than half of America’s eighth graders knew the purpose of the Bill of Rights, according to test results.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/05/education/05civics.html', 'snippet': 'Fewer than half of America’s eighth graders knew the purpose of the Bill of Rights, according to test results.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fewer than half of American eighth graders knew the purpose of the Bill of Rights on the most recent national civics examination, and only one in 10 demonstrated acceptable knowledge of the checks and balances among the legislative, executive and judicial branches, according to test results released on Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/us/CIVICS/CIVICS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/us/CIVICS/CIVICS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/05/us/CIVICS/CIVICS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Failing Grades on Civics Exam Called a ‘Crisis’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Civics Education Called National Crisis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Assessment of Educational Progress', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Connor, Sandra Day", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-04T15:19:57+0000', 'document_type': 'articl