ic his chambers on the Capitol’s second floor, a symbolic gesture toward transparent government that for the first time in over a decade allowed unfettered access to the vaulted and majestic Hall of Governors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Cuomo Against a Portrait, and Mothers Against Budget Cuts', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Mother's Day", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Mario M', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALBANY (NY)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-04T16:52:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b3739e0-4eac-533c-b626-c05160025401', 'word_count': 529, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b3739e0-4eac-533c-b626-c05160025401'}, {'abstract': 'Although Sony said it did not know who was responsible for the attacks on the PlayStation Network, it told a Congressional subcommittee that a hacking group called Anonymous played a role.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/04/sony-responds-to-lawmakers-citing-large-scale-cyberattack/', 'snippet': 'Although Sony said it did not know who was responsible for the attacks on the PlayStation Network, it told a Congressional subcommittee that a hacking group called Anonymous played a role.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sony responded to