_paragraph': 'From Tuesday to May 15, the town of Brimfield, Mass., population 3,600 or so, will swell to many times its size, straining to contain a flood of antiques dealers and the buyers who will rush the gates in search of treasure: a vintage shoe rack, a copper weather vane, a Staffordshire dog, an old postcard from Minnesota.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/garden/05qa-span/05qa-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 365, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/05/garden/05qa-span/05qa-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 365}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/garden/05qa-span/QA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/garden/05qa-span/05qa-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/05/garden/05qa-span/05qa-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Brimfield, Mass., Running the Antiques Show That Dad Founded', 'kicker': 'Currents | Q&A', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Brimfield, Mass., Running the Antiques Show That Dad Founded', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trade Shows and Fairs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-04T23:16:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sara Barrett', 'person': [{'fir