ague final at Wembley on May 28 will be a rematch of Rome two years ago, when Barcelona beat Manchester United, 2-0, with, of all things, a flying header from the diminutive Lionel Messi.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/world/05soccercnd_337/05soccercnd_337-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/world/05soccercnd_337/05soccercnd_337-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/05/world/05soccercnd_337/05soccercnd_337-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Best of the Best Are Back in the Final', 'kicker': 'On Soccer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Best of the Best Are Back in the Final', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Barcelona (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'FC Barcelona', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester United', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'UEFA Champions League (Soccer)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'FC Schalke 04', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Real Madrid', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester United (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-05T00:19:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rob Hughes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hughes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/599be2fb-c1b7-5caa-b772-b54ac51fdbb8', 'word_count': 837, 'uri': 'nyt://article/599be2fb-c1b7-5caa-b772-b54ac51fdbb8'}, {'abstract': 'A Roman Catholic bishop pleaded guilty in Ottawa on Wednesday to possession of child pornography for importation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/05/world/americas/05briefs-bishop.html', 'snippet': 'A Roman Catholic bishop pleaded guilty in Ottawa on Wednesday to possession of child pornography for importation.', 'lead_paragraph': ' A Roman Catholic bishop pleaded guilty in Ottawa on Wednesday to possession of child pornography for importation. Bishop Raymond Lahey, left, who once led the Diocese of Antigonish, Nova Scotia, was charged after customs agents examined his laptop computer as he returned to Canada from an overseas trip in 2009. They found 588 graphic images of children, 33 videos and the texts of stories featuring the enslavement of children. Customs officials estimated that some boys in the photographs were only 8 years old. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Canada: Bishop Pleads Guilty in Child Pornography Case', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | THE AMERICAS', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Canada: Bishop Pleads Guilty In Child Pornography Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Pornography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-05T00:19:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian A