, sets out to capture the beauty of the breed and the passion of the people whose lives revolve around the majestic creatures. From the breeding shed, to the auction ring, to the winner’s circle at Churchill Downs, this film takes you along for the joyful and sometimes heartbreaking journey through the world of horse racing. Wagner shared his thoughts about making the film, which includes footage of the road to the 2009 Derby. “Thoroughbred” premieres in the New York area at 10 p.m. Wednesday on WNET/Thirteen and nationally on PBS on Thursday at 9 p.m. Eastern.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q. and A. With Director of ‘Thoroughbred’', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kentucky Derby', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferguson, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCarthy, Tom', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mullins, Jeff', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wagner, Paul', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public Broadcasting Service', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-05T00:49:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Hoppert', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoppert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/0001229a-9eb0-5f3d-b9dd-ce91da162df4', 'word_count': 2738, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0001229a-9eb0-5f3d-b9dd-ce91da162df4'}, {'abstract': 'The raid that killed Osama bin Laden has provoked a crisis of confidence for what was long seen as the one institution that held Pakistan together.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/05/world/asia/05pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'The raid that killed Osama bin Laden has provoked a crisis of confidence for what was long seen as the one institution that held Pakistan together.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISLAMABAD, Pakistan — The reputation of the army, the most powerful and privileged force in Pakistan, has been severely undermined by the American raid that killed Osama bin Laden, raising profound questions about its credibility from people at home and from benefactors abroad, including the United States. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/world/05pakistan/05pakistan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 290, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/05/world/05pakistan/05pakistan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 290}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/world/05pakistan/05pakistan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 494, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/world/05pakistan/05pakistan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/05/world/05pakistan/05pakistan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pakistani Army, Shaken by Raid, Faces New Scrutiny', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pakistan Army Under Scrutiny After U.S. Raid', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value':