he ear of several would-be presidents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/us/sub-jp-BARTON/sub-jp-BARTON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/05/us/sub-jp-BARTON/sub-jp-BARTON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Using History to Mold Ideas on the Right', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'History Buff Sets a Course For the Right', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion-State Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barton, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huckabee, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachmann, Michele M', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-05T01:03:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Eckholm', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eckholm', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/32badf43-90c4-5a22-b169-a38f4bf5e9da', 'word_count': 1110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32badf43-90c4-5a22-b169-a38f4bf5e9da'}, {'abstract': 'For the first time in a decade, not a single winner of the six major Kentucky Derby prep races earned a Beyer Speed Figure of at least 100, considered the standard for a high-quality stakes champion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/05/sports/05racing.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time in a decade, not a single winner of the six major Kentucky Derby prep races earned a Beyer Speed Figure of at least 100, considered the standard for a high-quality stakes champion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOUISVILLE, Ky. — They drew the field for the 137th running of the Kentucky Derby on Wednesday, but it did little to clear up the intrigue over whether Uncle Mo, last year’s 2-year-old champion, will actually show up for the race Saturday. Nor did it solve the mystery of why this group of 3-year-old horses is so slow.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/sports/RACING/RACING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 658, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Derby Field Lacks Speed of Horses in the Past', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Derby Field Lacks Speed Of Horses Of the Past', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Triple Crown (Horse Racing)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pletcher, Todd', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Repole, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kentucky Derby', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-05T01:05:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Drape', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Drape', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organizatio