 pride over the successful mission to remove Osama bin Laden, few see much prospect of a dawn of bipartisanship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/05/us/politics/05obama.html', 'snippet': 'Despite national pride over the successful mission to remove Osama bin Laden, few see much prospect of a dawn of bipartisanship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — On Monday night President Obama welcomed dozens of Congressional leaders to dinner at the White House and expressed hope that they “can harness some of the unity” forged by the death of Osama bin Laden “to confront the many challenges that we still face.” On Thursday comes the biggest test of that, and few see much prospect of a dawn of bipartisanship. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/us/OBAMA/OBAMA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/05/us/OBAMA/OBAMA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/05/us/OBAMA/OBAMA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Brief Victory Lap Before Budget Fight Strains ‘Unity’ Call', 'kicker': 'Political Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Brief Victory Lap Before Budget Fight Strains ‘Unity’ Call', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-05T02:06:33