nteresting twist: it presupposes that people know about the dangers of multitasking behind the wheel. Instead, it illustrates the emotional toll for those who are affected by an accident caused by a person texting or talking on a phone. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Emotional Video Fights Distracted Driving', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Roads and Traffic', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Text Messaging', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-05T20:20:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Richtel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Richtel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/57255d64-2aee-5feb-8005-a9a29200bc1c', 'word_count': 317, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57255d64-2aee-5feb-8005-a9a29200bc1c'}, {'abstract': 'Supporters press their case at a news conference in the Capitol.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/05/commission-asks-congress-to-support-a-smithsonian-american-latino-museum/', 'snippet': 'Supporters press their case at a news conference in the Capitol.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A presidential commission called on Congress to establish a Smithsonian American Latino Museum at the Capitol on Thursday morning during a news conference attended by proponents of the project. In a report submitted this week to President Obama and Congress, the commission said that it would cost $600 million to build and open the museum, adding that half of the money could be raised privately. In deference to current budget conditions, the commission said that no federal financing would be needed for six years. Congress established the panel, the National Museum of the American Latino Commission, in 2008. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Commission Asks Congress to Support a Smithsonian American Latino Museum', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Becerra, Xavier', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Longoria, Eva', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salazar, Ken', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Smithsonian Institution', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-05T20:20:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/41515021-54f3-52ad-9127-538474f8506e', 'word_count': 188, 'uri': 'nyt://article/41515021-54f3-52ad-9127-538474f8506e'}, {'abstract': 'Biologists have approached the gray seal that washed up on Wednesday: she (yes, she is believed to be a she) is healthy but not necessarily leaving right away.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/05/seal-soaks-up-the-sun-on-the-isle-of-manhattan/', 'snippet': 'Biologists have approached the gray seal that washed up on Wednesday: she (yes, she is believed to be a she) is healthy but not necessarily leaving right away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The gray seal on the beach in upper Manhattan is a she.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Seal Soaks Up the Sun on the Isl