ame': 'Werschkul', 'lastname': 'Zena', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/cf2a8a0d-9b2e-5ba1-bbd4-72c4e477ed5c', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/cf2a8a0d-9b2e-5ba1-bbd4-72c4e477ed5c'}, {'abstract': 'Exude Fitness helps clients lose weight by jumping rope.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/06/arts/hop-skip-and-a-jump-to-fitness.html', 'snippet': 'Exude Fitness helps clients lose weight by jumping rope.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MY wedding day almost nine years ago was one of the most joyous days of my life. Gaining 15 pounds two years into the marital journey, however, was less than thrilling. Through a friend, I heard about Exude Fitness, a company in New York City that helps clients lose weight by jumping rope. Desperate to remove the evidence of too many overindulgent, albeit romantic meals, I scheduled a session with the company’s founder, Edward Jackowski.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '39', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06URBAN-span/URBAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06URBAN-span/URBAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06URBAN-span/URBAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 874, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06URBAN-span/URBAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06URBAN-span/URBAN-thumbSta