her (Ted Whittall) to a rural town from an unnamed city.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06DAYDREAM-span/DAYDREAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 336, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06DAYDREAM-span/DAYDREAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 336}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06DAYDREAM-span/DAYDREAM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 944, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06DAYDREAM-span/DAYDREAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06DAYDREAM-span/DAYDREAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Picking Up Extra Credit, and Teacher, After School', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Daydream Nation'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Picking Up Extra Credit, And Teacher, After School', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dennings, Kat', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-05T23:54:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7d5571b-e596-595e-a290-bc17b8cf9235', 'word_count': 790, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7d5571b-e596-595e-a290-bc17b8cf9235'}, {'abstract': 'Spring for Music, a new annual series of symphony and chamber orchestras that opens on Friday at Carnegie Hall, is based on inventive programming.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/06/arts/music/at-carnegie-hall-spring-for-music-festival.html', 'snippet': 'Spring for Music, a new annual series of symphony and chamber orchestras that opens on Friday at Carnegie Hall, is based on inventive programming.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN concert programming as elsewhere, invention carries an element of risk and uncertainty. Many an imaginative mix of compositions that seemed to sizzle on paper has fizzled onstage: too clever, perhaps, for its own good.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06MUSIC-span/MUSIC-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06MUSIC-span/MUSIC-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06MUSIC-span/MUSIC-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06MUSIC-span/MUSIC-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/06/arts/06MUSIC-span/MUSIC-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Festival Built for Risky Business', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Festival Built for Risky Business', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 