, and Home Depot and Lowe’s are giving you a clearer picture of the plant’s needs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHETHER it’s a piece of pipe or new kitchen cabinets, many Americans search for the right product in the aisles of home improvement stores like Home Depot or Lowe’s, trying to quickly identify what they need.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/business/Adco/Adco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Bar Code That Tells You How Much Water, Light and Fertilizer', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Bar Code That Tells You How Much Water, Light and Fertilizer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bar Codes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Lowe's Companies Inc", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Depot Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flowers and Plants', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-06T01:41:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elizabeth Olson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Olson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e9c1a380-b00a-56ed-b085-eadc62b03e77', 'word_count': 934, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9c1a380-b00a-56ed-b085-eadc62b03e77'}, {'abstract': 'Teamsters Local 705 began a campaign in the Chicago area demanding that U.P.S. reduce workloads and change what the union calls a “blame the worker” approach to health and safety.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/06/us/06cncups.html', 'snippet': 'Teamsters Local 705 began a campaign in the Chicago area demanding that U.P.S. reduce workloads and change what the union calls a “blame the worker” approach to health and safety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joe Korziuk has spent 23 years working for U.P.S. washing trucks, delivering packages and driving tractor trailers. Though he loves the job, it has a downside: At 45, he has had surgery on both knees and a shoulder, developed bulging disks in his back and sustained a concussion when boxes fell on him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/us/06cncups1/06cncups1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 746, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/06/us/06cncups1/06cncups1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/06/us/06cncups1/06cncups1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.P.S. Workers Demand New Approach to Safety', 'kicker': 'Chicago News Cooperative', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.P.S. Workers Demand New Approach to Safety', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Parcel Service Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Occupational Safety and Health Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-06T01:42:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kari Lydersen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lydersen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7262f863-c83a-51cc-b52e-fbd0bb8994f3', 'word_count': 1278, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7262f863-c83a-51cc-b52e-fbd0bb8994f3'}, {'abstract': 'The company reported a 17.4 percent increase in revenue, with improved ticket sales and sponsorship income helping the company to narrow its continuing losses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/06/business/06livenation.html', 'snippet': 'The company reported a 17.4 percent increase in revenue, with improved ticket sales and sponsorship income helping the company to narrow its continuing losses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Live Nation Entertainment, the concert and ticketing giant created last year by the merger of Ticketmaster and Live Nation, reported a 17.4 percent increase in revenue for the first quarter, with improved ticket sales and sponsorship income helping the company to narrow its continuing losses.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Live Nation Entertainment Narrows Loss on More Revenue', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Live Nation Entertainment Narrows Loss on More Revenue', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-06T01:43:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5033e870-9279-5835-9b0e-46116da7bcfb', 'word_count': 280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5033e870-9279-5835-9b0e-46116da7bcfb'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Rick Perry is expected to sign legislation that is a victory for anti-abortion advocates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/06/us/politics/06sonogram.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Rick Perry is expected to sign legislation that is a victory for anti-abortion advocates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — In a victory for anti-abortion advocates, Texas will join the ranks of states that require doctors to perform a sonogram before conducting an abortion. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Texas Passes Bill to Require Sonograms Before Abortions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pre-Abortion Sonogram Bill Passes in Texas', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Sid', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-06T01:44:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/df64f55a-362c-5f83-bc28-0b0070ba7695', 'word_count': 244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df64f55a-362c-5f83-bc28-0b0070ba7695'}, {'abstract': 'We’re a democracy, yes, but it’s time to revive the republican virtues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/06/opinion/06brooks.html', 'snippet': 'We’re a democracy, yes, but it’s time to revive the republican virtues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States, as you know, was founded as a republic, not simply as a democracy. The distinction has been lost over the past few decades, but it is an important one.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-articleLarge-v2.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-articleLarge-v2.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-superJumbo-v2.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-thumbLarg