260, 'uri': 'nyt://article/278cea92-f303-53b4-b57f-9b629be01974'}, {'abstract': 'The stock market is faring better than it did after the early 1970s recession. But by most other measures, the current recovery is far weaker.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/07/business/economy/07charts.html', 'snippet': 'The stock market is faring better than it did after the early 1970s recession. But by most other measures, the current recovery is far weaker.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TO judge by the stock market, the recovery from the Great Recession is much stronger than the one after the early 1970s recession, which followed the first oil price shock.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Recovery Less Robust Than in the ’70s', 'kicker': 'Off the Charts', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Recovery Less Robust Than in the ’70s', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-06T17:47:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Floyd Norris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Floyd', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Norris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/761e6ff9-6181-5562-ac60-0c79ecd03d29', 'word_count': 464, 'uri': 'nyt://article/761e6ff9-6181-5562-ac60-0c79ecd03d29'}, {'abstract': 'The private equity investors are said to be expect