d the bride serenaded the bridegroom at the reception with Stephen Sondheim’s “Sooner or Later.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'EVEN before she knew him, Amanda Pekoe liked Christopher Lueck for his look, and liked him even more when he changed it. She first encountered him in 1999 when they were both acting students at Brooklyn College and his long brown hair reached the collar of his motorcycle jacket. A perfect guitarist for her band, she thought — until “he said he didn’t play and brushed me off.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/07/fashion/weddings/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/07/fashion/weddings/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/07/fashion/weddings/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/07/fashion/weddings/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/07/fashion/weddings/VOWS-1/VOWS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Amanda Pekoe and Christopher Lueck', 'kicker': 'Vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amanda Pekoe and Christopher Lueck', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-06T18:40:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & St