-to-potential-fans/', 'snippet': 'Entering the best-seller list for paperback graphic books this week, at No. 4, is Vol. 1 of “Sensational She-Hulk,” by the writer and artist John Byrne.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Entering our paperback graphic books list this week, at No. 4, is Vol. 1 of “Sensational She-Hulk,” by the writer and artist John Byrne. The green giant, the cousin of the Incredible Hulk, had a series of adventures involving Spider-Man (no surprise), Santa Claus (it happens) and a conflict with Dr. Bong (now we’re getting a little more funky). The biggest twist of the series was that She-Hulk broke the fourth wall, often addressing her fans.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'She-Hulk Issues Warning to Potential Fans', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comic Books and Strips', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Frank', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'X-Men', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-06T19:09:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By George Gene Gustines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'George', 'middlename': 'Gene', 'lastname': 'Gustines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6bc9465-57fa-525e-ac77-5370c8eb9d14', 'word_count': 223, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6bc9465-57fa-525e-ac77-5370c8eb9d14'}, {'abstract': 'High above Washington Square Park, a mother red-tailed hawk tends to the first of her young to hatch.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/06/washington-square-1155-a-m/', 'snippet': 'High above Washington Square Park, a mother red-tailed hawk tends to the first of her young to hatch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s Violet the red-ta