rganization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/543c3715-e69c-57d7-9e5f-db93ffce5ce8', 'word_count': 572, 'uri': 'nyt://article/543c3715-e69c-57d7-9e5f-db93ffce5ce8'}, {'abstract': 'The tiny Italian island of Ponza — a geologist’s delight — has been a playground since Imperial times.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/08/travel/08overnighter-ponza.html', 'snippet': 'The tiny Italian island of Ponza — a geologist’s delight — has been a playground since Imperial times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ARRIVING by ferry or hydrofoil at Ponza, an island in the Tyrrhenian Sea, the boat trims the island’s eastern coast, a vista of sheer tuff cliffs bleached white by the sun and eroded by water and wind.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/travel/08overnighter-span/08overnighter-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/08/travel/08overnighter-span/08overnighter-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 351}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/travel/08overnighter-span/Overnighter-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/travel/08overnighter-span/08overnighter-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/08/travel/08overnighter-span/08overnighter-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Off the Roman Coast, Bobbing for Views', 'kicker': 'Overnighter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_h