ng-line-scratching-of-uncle-mo-is-no-surprise/', 'snippet': 'The Morning Line for Friday, May 6.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Uncle Mo melodrama has ended for the Derby with the decision this morning that Mo is a no-go. “Owner Mike Repole told reporters the colt hasn’t recovered well enough from his stomach ailment to handle the 1 1/4-mile distance,” according to USA Today. Jay Privman for the Daily Racing Form said that the news was expected,\xa0 and Joe Drape  similarly found that the scratch was not surprising since\xa0 Uncle Mo “has not looked like himself in the morning here and his owner, Mike Repole, has said all week that it was a 50-50 chance that Uncle Mo would run in America’s greatest race.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Morning Line: Scratching of Uncle Mo Is No Surprise', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-06T20:41:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bennett Liebman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bennett', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liebman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/117f9cec-1703-5620-9907-5378cbd6b014', 'word_count': 810, 'uri': 'nyt://article/117f9cec-1703-5620-9907-5378cbd6b014'}, {'abstract': 'Letter in response to Michael Beschloss’s review of “The Age of Airpower,” by Martin van Creveld.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/08/books/review/strategic-deployment.html', 'snippet': 'Letter in response to Michael Beschloss’s review of “The Age of Airpower,” by Martin van Creveld.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Strategic Deployment', 'kicker': 'Letters', 'content_kicker