s a friend of the commissioner and the Dodgers’ Frank McCourt is not.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/07/sports/baseball/07rhoden.html', 'snippet': 'A significant difference is that the Mets’ Fred Wilpon is a friend of the commissioner and the Dodgers’ Frank McCourt is not.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Thursday, after the Mets defeated the San Francisco Giants, 5-2, Fred Wilpon stood off to the side in a wide corridor near the Mets’ clubhouse at Citi Field and interacted with friends and their families. Wilpon, the Mets’ owner, casually greeted players, kissed their newborn babies and congratulated expectant mothers. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/07/sports/y--rhoden-1/y--rhoden-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 869, 'width': 858, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/07/sports/y--rhoden-1/y--rhoden-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/07/sports/y--rhoden-1/y--rhoden-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dissecting the Twin Tales of Teams in Distress', 'kicker': 'Sports of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dissecting the Twin Tales of Teams in Distress', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Franchises', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Dodgers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilpon, Fred', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCourt, Frank H Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'v