', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Churchill Downs Incorporated', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-07T00:57:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie June Stewart', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': 'June', 'lastname': 'Stewart', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe742df8-e9f7-5b8f-bd08-b068767729ce', 'word_count': 613, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe742df8-e9f7-5b8f-bd08-b068767729ce'}, {'abstract': 'Steven A. Cohen, with a net worth of $8 billion, appears to be a serious player in the bidding to purchase a minority share of the Mets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/07/sports/baseball/07partner.html', 'snippet': 'Steven A. Cohen, with a net worth of $8 billion, appears to be a serious player in the bidding to purchase a minority share of the Mets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With a net worth of $8 billion, Steven A. Cohen, who is in the bidding to purchase a minority stake in the Mets, unquestionably has the money to buy a sizable chunk of the franchise.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/07/sports/y-jp-partner/y-jp-partner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 613, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/07/sports/y-jp-partner/y-jp-partner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/07/sports/y-jp-partner/y-jp-partner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Top Mets S