ion, and helped shield him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/07/world/asia/07policy.html', 'snippet': 'Pakistan says the United States has demanded the identities of operatives amid suspicion that Pakistan’s intelligence agency knew of Osama bin Laden’s location, and helped shield him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Pakistani officials say the Obama administration has demanded the identities of some of their top intelligence operatives as the United States tries to determine whether any of them had contact with Osama bin Laden or his agents in the years before the raid that led to his death early Monday morning in Pakistan.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/07/world/middleeast/PROTEST-REFER/PROTEST-REFER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/07/world/middleeast/PROTEST-REFER/PROTEST-REFER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/07/world/middleeast/PROTEST-REFER/PROTEST-REFER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Demands More From Pakistan in Bin Laden Inquiry', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Demands More From Pakistan as Details of Bin Laden’s Movements Emerge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Inter-S