746e3abe-22f2-5cca-a095-6c998abaf6c5', 'word_count': 318, 'uri': 'nyt://article/746e3abe-22f2-5cca-a095-6c998abaf6c5'}, {'abstract': 'At Chengdu 23, where the chef carries the mantle of an elite culinary line, scents like jasmine and garlic swell your appetite, and your adventurousness, before you begin to eat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/08/nyregion/chengdu-23-serves-up-a-szechuan-adventure-review.html', 'snippet': 'At Chengdu 23, where the chef carries the mantle of an elite culinary line, scents like jasmine and garlic swell your appetite, and your adventurousness, before you begin to eat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SQUEEZED next to a Home Goods store behind the Willowbrook Mall in Wayne, Chengdu 23 looks like little more than a place for weary shoppers to get a quick pick-me-up of moo shu or kung pao. But something happens when you take your seat, scan the menu and inhale scents of jasmine, garlic and others, harder to name, that waft by with every passing plate. Your appetite swells, as does your adventurousness.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/nyregion/08DINENJ2/08DINENJ2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/08/nyregion/08DINENJ2/08DINENJ2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/nyregion/08DINENJ2/08DINENJ2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Szechuan Adventure Behind a Shopping Mall', 'kicker': 'New Jersey Dining | Wayne', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Szechuan Adventure Behind a Shopping Mall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 