o raid of the compound where Osama bin Laden was killed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Obama administration has briefed reporters on Saturday, including The Times’s Elisabeth Bumiller, on the contents of some videos seized during the commando raid of Osama bin Laden’s compound in Abbottabad, Pakistan. The Lede will provide updates. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Briefing on Bin Laden Documents', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Abbottabad (Pakistan)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-07T16:23:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elizabeth A. Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/804bd137-398d-5efb-b872-d4f15b7e4664', 'word_count': 660, 'uri': 'nyt://article/804bd137-398d-5efb-b872-d4f15b7e4664'}, {'abstract': 'A Minnesota legislator took aim at the writer Neil Gaiman, for accepting a $45,000 speaking fee from the state.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/08/weekinreview/08fight.html', 'snippet': 'A Minnesota legislator took aim at the writer Neil Gaiman, for accepting a $45,000 speaking fee from the state.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Minnesota legislator took aim at the writer Neil Gaiman, for accepting a $45,000 speaking fee from the state. (Mr. Gaiman says he gave the money to charity.)', 'print_section': 'WK', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/weekinreview/08fight/08fight-thumbStandard.jpg', 'heigh