rmer Yankees catcher now relegated to D.H. duty, is hitting .149.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/08/sports/baseball/08posada.html', 'snippet': 'Six weeks into the season, Jorge Posada, the former Yankees catcher now relegated to D.H. duty, is hitting .149.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ARLINGTON, Tex. — It took one question for Jorge Posada to release six weeks of disappointment, one question for his emotions to come tumbling out, and once they did he could not stop. At first, he described his season as “a little frustrating.” The next sentence, he called it “really frustrating.” By the end of his 28-second response, it had become “very frustrating,” and anyone in the same ZIP code as Posada on Friday night, with his brow furrowed and his arms crossed, could sense how much this all gnaws at him.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/sports/Y-POSADA/Y-POSADA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 732, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/sports/Y-POSADA/Y-POSADA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/08/sports/Y-POSADA/Y-POSADA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Posada Fights to Keep Positive Outlook', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Frustration Growing, Posada Tries to Stay Positive', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Posada, Jorge', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-07T17:03:48+00