n Victorian New England, is not characteristic Mamet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HUDSON STAGE is doing a David Mamet play. You know what that means: fast-talking, hard-driving, foulmouthed men like the real estate agents in “Glengarry Glen Ross,” the small-time crooks in “American Buffalo” and the Hollywood types in “Speed-the-Plow.”', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/nyregion/08THEATWE/08THEATWE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/08/nyregion/08THEATWE/08THEATWE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/nyregion/08THEATWE/08THEATWE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/08/nyregion/08THEATWE/08THEATWE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/08/nyregion/08THEATWE/08THEATWE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'David Mamet, Gone Victorian', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'David Mamet, Gone Victorian', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mamet, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hudson Stage Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-08T00:02:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'secti