qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/a821cd49-0177-59ec-9a6a-e5c0a5e46844', 'word_count': 729, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a821cd49-0177-59ec-9a6a-e5c0a5e46844'}, {'abstract': 'Before their loss to the Dodgers, the Mets put pitcher Chris Young on the 15-day disabled list because of tightness in the back of his throwing shoulder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/09/sports/baseball/09mets.html', 'snippet': 'Before their loss to the Dodgers, the Mets put pitcher Chris Young on the 15-day disabled list because of tightness in the back of his throwing shoulder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Black equipment bags cluttered the floor of the Mets’ clubhouse late Sunday afternoon, a sign that the team was about to hit the road. So much has gone right for the Mets in the last 18 days that they generally regarded splitting a six-game homestand as a disappointment.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/09/sports/baseball/09metspix/09metspix-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/09/sports/baseball/09metspix/09metspix-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/09/sports/baseball/09metspix/09metspix-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/09/sports/baseball/09metspix/09metspix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/09/sports/baseba