t in 2005 in Verdi’s “Don Carlo.” In the last couple of seasons Mr. Luisi has appeared at the company mostly as a pinch-hitter for James Levine. In April he stepped in again for an ailing Mr. Levine and conducted a compelling performance of Wagner’s “Rheingold.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/09/arts/ARIADNE/ARIADNE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 358, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/09/arts/ARIADNE/ARIADNE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 358}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/09/arts/ARIADNE/ARIADNE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/09/arts/ARIADNE/ARIADNE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/09/arts/ARIADNE/ARIADNE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Plush and Lyrical Strauss (and That’s Just the Conducting)', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Plush and Lyrical Strauss (and That’s Just the Conducting)', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Luisi, Fabio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Opera', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strauss, Richard', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-08T21:53:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Musi