rkers, and a Brooklyn grand jury is investigating a city agency’s failures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/09/nyregion/short-bleak-life-of-marchella-pierce-emaciated-4-year-old.html', 'snippet': 'Four people have been charged in a girl’s death, including two child welfare workers, and a Brooklyn grand jury is investigating a city agency’s failures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'She died in September by the ugliest means, weighing an unthinkable 18 pounds, half what a 4-year-old ought to. She withered in poverty in a home in Brooklyn where the authorities said she had been drugged and often bound to a toddler bed by her mother, having realized a bare thimble’s worth of living. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/09/nyregion/CHILD2/CHILD2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 870, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/09/nyregion/CHILD2/CHILD2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/09/nyregion/CHILD2/CHILD2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Bleak Life, Cut Short at 4, Harrowing From the Start', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Bleak Life, Cut Short at 4, Harrowing From the Start', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brett-Pierce, Carlotta', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pierce, Marchella', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bell, Chereece', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Administration for Ch