nytimes.com/2011/05/09/bronx-zoo-944-a-m/', 'snippet': 'N.Y. See: Before taking the oath of citizenship, a 10-year-old poses with a person in a beaver suit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Enutifa Gamia, 10, and Jordan Gamia, 4, posed with the Bronx Zoo’s mascot, Jose the beaver, before Enutifa, who is from Togo, took the citizenship oath in a ceremony at the zoo at which 35 children from 14 countries became citizens. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bronx Zoo, 9:44 A.M.', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-09T22:45:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c0f7ac6-ed13-5131-86c9-cb5c83d73bc0', 'word_count': 42, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c0f7ac6-ed13-5131-86c9-cb5c83d73bc0'}, {'abstract': 'Ann Curry, who has read the news on NBC’s “Today” show for 15 years, will succeed Meredith Vieira as a co-host of television’s dominant morning show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/10/business/media/10network.html', 'snippet': 'Ann Curry, who has read the news on NBC’s “Today” show for 15 years, will succeed Meredith Vieira as a co-host of television’s dominant morning show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ann Curry will replace Meredith Vieira as co-host of the “Today” show, NBC announced Monday, confirming much-anticipated changes in the cast of its perennially dominant morning show. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/10/business/Network/Network-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None,