tone, a legendary Manhattan dealer, was the subject of a special sale at Sotheby’s on Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/10/arts/design/art-from-allan-stone-estate-sells-for-55-million.html', 'snippet': 'The collection of Mr. Stone, a legendary Manhattan dealer, was the subject of a special sale at Sotheby’s on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sculptures fashioned from mangled bits of old cars, and paintings depicting cakes topped with fluffy frosting, gave a peek at the visual world of Allan Stone, the legendary Manhattan dealer who died in 2006, and whose collection was the subject of a special sale at Sotheby’s on Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/10/nyregion/AUCTION/AUCTION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 835, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Art From Allan Stone Estate Is a Big Draw at Sotheby’s', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Art From Allan Stone Estate Is a Big Draw at Sotheby’s', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thiebaud, Wayne', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stone, Allan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chamberlain, John', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bugatti Motors', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sotheby's", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-10T02:59:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier