were among the winners of this year’s National Magazine awards.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York magazine, a favorite in recent years among judges for the National Magazine awards, received the coveted general interest prize for a news, sports or entertainment publication, along with one other award on Monday evening.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Magazines’ Top Honors Given Out', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-10T15:03:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeremy W. Peters', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeremy', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Peters', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/861312fc-3c9f-5326-bbbe-fbfcbf1f8ac1', 'word_count': 300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/861312fc-3c9f-5326-bbbe-fbfcbf1f8ac1'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the DealBook newsletter.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/05/10/morning-take-out-240/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the DealBook newsletter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Microsoft to Buy Skype for $8.5 Billion | Microsoft announced on Tuesday that it would buy Skype Global for $8.5 billion in cash, in its largest acquisition ever.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Take-Out', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-10T15:20:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastn