ars with running for president, Newt Gingrich officially declared Wednesday that he is a candidate for the 2012 Republican nomination.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After flirting for years with running for president, Newt Gingrich, the former speaker of the House, officially declared Wednesday that he is a candidate for the 2012 Republican nomination, claiming the mantle of Ronald Reagan and urging Americans to “talk together, work together and find solutions together.” In a video posted on the Internet, Mr. Gingrich, 67, promoted his tenure as leader of the House and said: “We’ve done it before. We can do it again.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich Officially Enters 2012 Race', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | WASHINGTON', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gingrich Officially Enters 2012 Race', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-11T23:45:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e14ca13-f32d-5b5b-b0f4-b03f38f14afd', 'word_count': 77, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e14ca13-f32d-5b5b-b0f4-b03f38f14afd'}, {'abstract': 'The Port Authority has struggled to create an elegant and secure skyscraper while also containing costs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/12/nyregion/at-1-world-trade-center-effort-to-cover-base-in-glass-is-dropped.h