}, {'abstract': 'Eurovision, the Continental battle of the bands, is often dismissed as tacky but the contest may be just the thing that Europe needs right now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/13/arts/13iht-eurovision13.html', 'snippet': 'Eurovision, the Continental battle of the bands, is often dismissed as tacky but the contest may be just the thing that Europe needs right now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DÜSSELDORF, Germany — When the Armenian singer known as Emmy appeared onstage sitting in an oversize boxing glove on Tuesday night, European viewers knew that at least one performer was upholding the traditions that the Eurovision Song Contest is known for: an over-the-top stage performance and a forgettable tune sung in questionable English.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13iht-eurovision13-span/13iht-eurovision13-span-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13iht-eurovision13-span/13iht-eurovision13-span-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13iht-eurovision13-span/13iht-eurovision13-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13iht-eurovision13-span/13iht-eurovision13-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13iht-eurovision13-span/13iht-eurovision13-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Uniting a Continent Through a Wacky Song Contest', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Uniting a Continent Through Wacky Song', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eurovision Song Contest', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-12T14:59:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Ewing', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bff87cb-a839-5b71-af95-fae56b570387', 'word_count': 1192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bff87cb-a839-5b71-af95-fae56b570387'}, {'abstract': 'Richard Bove of Rochdale Securities dropped his rating to sell on the investment bank, saying on Thursday that pressure was building for the Justice Department to take action against Goldman Sachs.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/05/12/shares-of-goldman-drop-after-downgrade/', 'snippet': 'Richard Bove of Rochdale Securities dropped his rating to sell on the investment bank, saying on Thursday that pressure was building for the Justice Department to take action against Goldman Sachs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shares of Goldman Sachs are under pressure following a scathing report from an outspoken industry analyst. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Goldman’s Shares Drop Sharply After Downgrade', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taibbi, 