rdon-Levitt as a tattooed, profanity-spewing, heavy-metal life force. And guess what? He has lessons to teach.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/13/movies/hesher-from-spencer-susser-stars-joseph-gordon-levitt.html', 'snippet': 'Spencer Susser’s “Hesher” stars Joseph Gordon-Levitt as a tattooed, profanity-spewing, heavy-metal life force. And guess what? He has lessons to teach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The only reason to see “Hesher” is to cringe before Joseph Gordon-Levitt’s portrayal of its scary, hot-wired title character, a violent California drifter who barges into the home of a grieving suburban family and is given the run of the house.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13HESHER-span/HESHER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13HESHER-span/HESHER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13HESHER-span/HESHER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 934, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13HESHER-span/HESHER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/13/arts/13HESHER-span/HESHER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Burn This, Curse That, Wreak Your Havoc', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Hesher'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Burn This, Curse That, Wreak Your Havoc', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'ra