ets. An error by Bill Buckner led to a run and helped open the door for a Mets victory. But it wasn’t Game 6 of the 1986 World Series; it was a September exhibition game between the teams to benefit Boston’s Jimmy Fund and the New York Amateur Baseball Foundation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/sports/baseball/13jimmy/13jimmy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 661, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/sports/baseball/13jimmy/13jimmy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/13/sports/baseball/13jimmy/13jimmy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Now Batting for Charity, a Sabermetrician', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Now Batting for Charity, a Sabermetrician', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statistics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jimmy Fund', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-12T22:29:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b230d62b-2ecd-5055-a425-77b3e395c0a2', 'word_count': 603, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b230d62b-2ecd-5055-a425-77b3e395c0a2'}, {'abstract': 'A selected guide to theater performances in New York.', 