 603, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69e4a879-4159-5a10-a38f-5d6ac835d439'}, {'abstract': 'When an 8-year-old boy gets fed up and leaves home, he meets some strange characters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/15/books/review/childrens-books-noah-barleywater-runs-away-by-john-boyne.html', 'snippet': 'When an 8-year-old boy gets fed up and leaves home, he meets some strange characters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the morning that 8-year-old Noah Barleywater runs away, before he has gotten very far, an oddly short man pushing a cat in a wheelbarrow accuses him of making him late for a veterinary appointment. “If that happens, my cat is sure to die. And it will be all your fault. You really are a monstrous little boy.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/books/review/Lowry/Lowry-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 766, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/books/review/Lowry/Lowry-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/15/books/review/Lowry/Lowry-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Runaway’s Curious Adventures', 'kicker': 'Children’s Books', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Puppet Master', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boyne, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puppets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-13T01:42:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline'