d from his right knee.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/13/sports/basketball/jeffries-has-knee-operation.html', 'snippet': 'Knicks forward Jared Jeffries had damaged tissue removed from his right knee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Knicks forward Jared Jeffries had damaged tissue removed from his right knee. He is expected to recover in six to eight weeks, the team said. Jeffries returned to the Knicks last season after being waived by Houston. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeffries Has Knee Operation', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Pro Basketball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jeffries Has Knee Operation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeffries, Jared', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-13T01:57:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Abrams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abrams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/89c8f670-2f11-57e8-837e-6db0df799aee', 'word_count': 38, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89c8f670-2f11-57e8-837e-6db0df799aee'}, {'abstract': 'More than 300 buyers of units in troubled luxury high-rises are suing Donald Trump, the real estate mogul, saying they were deceived.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/13/nyregion/feeling-deceived-over-homes-that-were-trump-in-name-only.html', 'snippet': 'More than 300 buyers of units in troubled luxury high-rises are suing Donald Trump, the real estate mogul, saying they were deceived.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For many