er-man-returns-with-just-a-few-glitches.html', 'snippet': 'The musical “Spider-Man: Turn Off the Dark” resumed performances on Broadway after an unusual, three-and-a-half week hiatus and creative overhaul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With a streamlined plot pitting young love against duty, and a conflicted superhero against a droll supervillain, the musical “Spider-Man: Turn Off the Dark” resumed performances on Broadway on Thursday after an unusual, three-and-a-half-week hiatus and creative overhaul that the producers hope will give the $70 million show a stronger shot at financial and critical success.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/nyregion/SPIDERMAN/SPIDERMAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/13/nyregion/SPIDERMAN/SPIDERMAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/13/nyregion/SPIDERMAN/SPIDERMAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Revamped ‘Spider-Man’ Returns, With More Romance and More Goblin', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Revamped ‘Spider-Man’ Returns, With Just a Few Glitches', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bono', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taymor, Julie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Edge, The', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Damiano, Jennifer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McKinley, Philip William', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}