0d5732fc'}, {'abstract': 'Cullen Jones barely held off Josh Schneider in a 50-meter freestyle sprint in Charlotte, N.C., to earn the final spot on the United States team for the world championships in July.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/13/sports/final-us-roster-spot-is-won.html', 'snippet': 'Cullen Jones barely held off Josh Schneider in a 50-meter freestyle sprint in Charlotte, N.C., to earn the final spot on the United States team for the world championships in July.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cullen Jones barely held off Josh Schneider in a 50-meter freestyle sprint in Charlotte, N.C., to earn the final spot on the United States team for the world championships in July in Shanghai. Jones beat Schneider by four-hundredths of a second, winning in 22.24 seconds. The swim-off was necessary because the two posted identical times of 21.97 to finish second at the United States senior nationals last August. But the competition was delayed because Schneider, 23, broke his hand during a later event in the nationals. More at nytimes.com.  ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Final U.S. Roster Spot Is Won', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Swimming', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Final U.S. Roster Spot Is Won', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Cullen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swimming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schneider, Josh', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-13T04:26:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Viv Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Viv', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e00cbc1-a3c