 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/05/15/automobiles/autoreviews/15wheel-slideshow.html', 'snippet': 'The 2011 Audi A5 and S5 coupes and convertibles are exquisitely styled, but lacking in character.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 2011 Audi A5 and S5 coupes and convertibles are exquisitely styled, but lacking in character.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/automobiles/autoreviews/15wheel-slideshow-slide-AL3P/15wheel-slideshow-slide-AL3P-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/automobiles/autoreviews/15wheel-slideshow-slide-AL3P/15wheel-slideshow-slide-AL3P-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/15/automobiles/autoreviews/15wheel-slideshow-slide-AL3P/15wheel-slideshow-slide-AL3P-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Search of Star Power', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-13T19:06:47+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Automobiles', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'subsection_name': 'New Cars', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/fda8697d-9dce-5f79-806f-95d66bdd89eb', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/fda8697d-9dce-5f79-806f-95d66bdd89eb'}, {'abstract': 'A former Greenwich Village psychic is sought by the police after persuading a client to give her nearly $30,000.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/14/nyregion/psychic-is-expert-in-teaching-how-to-let-go-of-money.html', 'snippet': 'A former Greenwich Village psychic is sought by the police after persuading a client to give her nearly $30,000.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Can psychics see their own futures? If so, Sylvia Mitchell, 36, peering into her crystal ball on a busy corner of Greenwich Village, might have caught a glimpse of her driver’s license photo, blown up and attached to an unpleasant poster saying “Wanted” and “Grand Larceny” and “$28,000.” And so she apparently took off. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/14/nyregion/ALT-CRIMESCENE/ALT-CRIMESCENE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/14/nyregion/ALT-CRIMESCENE/ALT-CRIMESCENE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/14/nyregion/ALT-CRIMESCENE/ALT-CRIMESCENE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/14/nyregion/ALT-CRIMESCENE/ALT-CRIMESCENE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/14/nyregion/ALT-CRIMESCENE/ALT-CRIMESCENE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Your Palm’s Telling Me You Must Let Go. Of $27,000.', 'kicker': 'Crime Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Your Palm’s Telling Me You Must Let Go. Of $27,000.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greenwich Village (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam