 bridegroom is a vice president in the residential mortgage-backed securities group at Deutsche Bank in Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/15/fashion/weddings/johanna-vespe-anthony-aulisa-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'The bride helps men and women on probation or parole find employment; the bridegroom is a vice president in the residential mortgage-backed securities group at Deutsche Bank in Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Johanna King Vespe and Anthony Jerome Aulisa were married Saturday at the Regis High School Chapel in Manhattan. The Rev. Philip Judge, a Roman Catholic priest and the school’s president, performed the ceremony.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Johanna Vespe, Anthony Aulisa', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Johanna Vespe, Anthony Aulisa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-13T19:45:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/850d6947-68e3-5dea-8111-4e14afecacd4', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/850d6947-68e3-5dea-8111-4e14afecacd4'}, {'abstract': 'The bride and the bridegroom both work for Wells Fargo Bank in the company’s East Coast headquarters in Charlotte, N.C.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/15/fashion/weddings/megan-barrick-harvey-taylor-ii-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'The bride and the bridegroom both work for Wells Fargo Bank in the company’s East Coast headquarters in Charlotte, N.C.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Megan Frances Barrick and Harvey Parnell Taylor II were married Saturday afternoon at the Cathedral of St. Patrick in Charlotte, N.C. The Rev. Christopher A. Roux, the cat