 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/37f6ce12-c257-5ac6-9ee4-0aefbd46b3d4', 'word_count': 134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/37f6ce12-c257-5ac6-9ee4-0aefbd46b3d4'}, {'abstract': 'The combination of hiking and wine tasting has a name: wiking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/15/travel/wiking-in-oregon-combining-hiking-and-wine-tasting.html', 'snippet': 'The combination of hiking and wine tasting has a name: wiking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OREGON is hiking country. It’s also wine country, with vineyards that are increasingly destinations for oenophiles. So perhaps it’s no surprise that the combination of hiking and wine tasting has a name: wiking.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/travel/15headsupspan/15headsupspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/15/travel/15headsupspan/15headsupspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/travel/15headsupspan/15headsupspan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/travel/15headsupspan/15headsupspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/15/travel/15headsupspan/15headsupspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vines and Valleys in Oregon', 'kicker': 'The U.S. Issue: Heads Up', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vines and Valleys in Oregon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oregon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hiking', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-13T20:13:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Margulis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Margulis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/69cdccfb-5631-5ce8-912d-d4203466b6b0', 'word_count': 592, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69cdccfb-5631-5ce8-912d-d4203466b6b0'}, {'abstract': 'The author finds that getting her son to hike involves some ingenuity and jelly beans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/15/travel/hiking-with-a-child-and-tricks-in-tow-personal-journeys.html', 'snippet': 'The author finds that getting her son to hike involves some ingenuity and jelly beans.', 'lead_paragraph': '“CHARLIE likes a lot of outdoor things,” said my son Gus, then 4 1/2, about a friend who likes nothing more than classifying lichens in the forest. “I like indoor things.” This was, and still is, true. Gus can spend hours with his cheek on his bedroom rug, building Lego space stations and acting out savage battles upon them. Two years ago, summer break from preschool meant to Gus a happy vacation from being trundled off to parks and beaches with the rest of his class. But I had a different idea. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/travel/15journeysspan/15journeysspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'h