cured minefield at T.P.C. Sawgrass in the second round of the Players Championship, David Toms birdied six holes and bogeyed two for a tidy round of 68.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/14/sports/golf/david-toms-takes-lead-in-players-championship.html', 'snippet': 'Playing on the manicured minefield at T.P.C. Sawgrass in the second round of the Players Championship, David Toms birdied six holes and bogeyed two for a tidy round of 68.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PONTE VEDRA BEACH, Fla. — It has been awhile since David Toms last won a PGA Tour event, but in the past few weeks he has looked more and more like someone who remembers just how he won a dozen of them before his 40th birthday.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/14/sports/golf/golf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/14/sports/golf/golf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/14/sports/golf/golf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Toms Skips the Pitfalls of T.P.C. Sawgrass and Grabs the Lead', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Toms Skips the Pitfalls of T.P.C. Sawgrass and Grabs a One-Stroke Lead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Toms, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-14T01:21:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Dorman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'm