first-round draft pick for the Boston Red Sox in 2003, now holds the single-season record for hits — in Japan, that is.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/14/sports/baseball/matt-murton-breaks-records-in-japan.html', 'snippet': 'Matt Murton, a first-round draft pick for the Boston Red Sox in 2003, now holds the single-season record for hits — in Japan, that is.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GINOZA, Japan — Few foreigners are likely to learn the word akage no matter how long they play baseball in Japan, but Matt Murton will hear it a lot in just his second season here. Adoring fans use the word to describe the top of his crown — redhead — an unusual sight in Japan.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/14/sports/y-matt-2/y-matt-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 838, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/14/sports/y-matt-2/y-matt-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/14/sports/y-matt-2/y-matt-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From a Footnote in American Baseball to a Record-Breaker in Japan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From a Footnote in American Baseball to a Record-Breaker in Japan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Red Sox', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-14T01:36:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseba