 concession to his critics, President Obama announced several steps to accelerate drilling on public lands and waters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama, facing voter anger over high gasoline prices and complaints from Republicans and business leaders that his policies are restricting the development of domestic energy resources, announced Saturday that he was taking several steps to speed oil and gas drilling on public lands and waters. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Shifts to Speed Oil and Gas Drilling in U.S.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In a Shift, Obama Moves to Speed Drilling for Oil and Gas on Public Lands', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Land Use Policies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Offshore Drilling and Exploration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gulf of Mexico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARCTIC OCEAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drilling and Boring', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-14T10:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By John M. Broder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb4a4f9c-91e1-5d52-8f15-a4c6d7623488', 'wo