icago for 42 of the last 55 years, has been blamed for plenty and credited with more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/15/us/15daley.html', 'snippet': 'Richard M. Daley, whose family ran Chicago for 42 of the last 55 years, has been blamed for plenty and credited with more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — Yes, there will be the shock of not going to work on the fifth floor of City Hall on Monday, as Mayor Richard M. Daley has for more than two decades. But there are more pressing matters to worry about. Like getting used to carrying a wallet, buying a cellphone, and remembering how to drive a car.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/us/DALEY/DALEY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/us/DALEY/DALEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/15/us/DALEY/DALEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Daley’s Next Task: Adapting to Life Outside City Hall', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Daley’s Next Task: Adapting to Life Outside City Hall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Daley, Richard M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mayors', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-14T23:44:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Monica Davey', 'person':