ttps://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/15/world/middleeast/15prince.html', 'snippet': 'Erik Prince has been hired to assemble a force of foreign troops in the United Arab Emirates, according to a variety of sources.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ABU DHABI, United Arab Emirates — Late one night last November, a plane carrying dozens of Colombian men touched down in this glittering seaside capital. Whisked through customs by an Emirati intelligence officer, the group boarded an unmarked bus and drove roughly 20 miles to a windswept military complex in the desert sand.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/world/15prince1_span/sub-prince-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/15/world/15prince1_span/sub-prince-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/world/15prince1_span/sub-prince-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/world/15prince1_span/sub-prince-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/15/world/15prince1_span/sub-prince-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Secret Desert Force Set Up by Blackwater’s Founder', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Secret Desert Force Set Up By Blackwater’s Founder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Abu Dhabi (United Arab Emirates)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Xe Services', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prince, Erik D', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private Military Contractors', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nahyan, Mohamed bin Zayed al- (1961- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mercenaries', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-15T00:17:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Mazzetti and Emily B. Hager', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mazzetti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aad05b67-ddbb-5064-a53c-e50beeb8f0d8', 'word_count': 3063, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aad05b67-ddbb-5064-a53c-e50beeb8f0d8'}, {'abstract': 'Derek Boogaard, an enforcer signed last season by the Rangers, was found dead in his Minnesota apartment. His family authorized Boston University researchers to examine his brain for damage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/15/sports/hockey/rangers-enforcer-boogaard-is-found-dead-at-his-minneapolis-apartment.html', 'snippet': 'Derek Boogaard, an enforcer signed last season by the Rangers, was found dead in his Minnesota apartment. His family authorized Boston University researchers to examine his brain for damage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In poll after poll of N.H.L. players it was always a landslide: Derek Boogaard was the toughest, most feared fighter in the league. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/1