act': 'As speculation about Jorge Posada swirled for nine innings, the Yankees lost their fourth straight game as the offense floundered against Josh Beckett.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/15/sports/baseball/yanks-night-starts-oddly-then-turns-to-disaster.html', 'snippet': 'As speculation about Jorge Posada swirled for nine innings, the Yankees lost their fourth straight game as the offense floundered against Josh Beckett.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Yankees’ night began on a curious note, with an announcement shortly before the first pitch that Jorge Posada, penciled into the No. 9 spot in the team’s batting order by Manager Joe Girardi, had been scratched from the lineup.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/sports/15yankees-1/15yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/15/sports/15yankees-1/15yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/15/sports/15yankees-1/15yankees-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yanks’ Night Starts Oddly, Then Turns to Disaster', 'kicker': 'Red Sox 6, Yankees 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After a Strange Start, the Yankees’ Night Ends in Disaster at Boston’s Hands', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cashman, Brian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Red Sox', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Girardi, Joe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Posada, Jorge', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations'