'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d37e818a-ff33-572a-9bcf-43adb153cd99', 'word_count': 778, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d37e818a-ff33-572a-9bcf-43adb153cd99'}, {'abstract': 'Justin Turner had the answer to some high inside pitches when he hit a two-run double and a three-run homer in the Mets’ 7-2 victory over Houston.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/16/sports/turners-five-rbi-lead-mets-to-win-over-astros.html', 'snippet': 'Justin Turner had the answer to some high inside pitches when he hit a two-run double and a three-run homer in the Mets’ 7-2 victory over Houston.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — Justin Turner, the Mets’ surging second baseman, is playing well enough that on Sunday, Mets Manager Terry Collins heaped his highest praise on him.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/16/sports/YMETS/YMETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/16/sports/YMETS/YMETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/16/sports/YMETS/YMETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Turner, the Second Baseman Come Lately, Breaks Out', 'kicker': 'Mets 7, Astros 4', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turner, the Second Baseman Come Lately, Breaks Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Turner, Justin (1984- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houston Astros', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], '