nted,” the long-running series that profiles — and sometimes helps find — fugitives.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/16/upfronts-fox-sidelines-americas-most-wanted/', 'snippet': 'Fox on Monday announced the effective end of “America’s Most Wanted,” the long-running series that profiles — and sometimes helps find — fugitives.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most of Fox’s 2011-12 schedule was predictable, but there was one surprise when it was revealed on Monday morning: the effective end of “America’s Most Wanted,” the long-running series that profiles — and sometimes helps find — fugitives.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Upfronts: Fox Sidelines ‘America’s Most Wanted’', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reilly, Kevin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NEWS CORP', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-16T13:50:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/19006c64-f472-59da-ab3e-ea4fb9dd78bf', 'word_count': 258, 'uri': 'nyt://article/19006c64-f472-59da-ab3e-ea4fb9dd78bf'}, {'abstract': 'Many nursing home employees do not have health insurance — and will not, if nursing homes gain an exemption from the new health care law.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/16/nursing-homes-seek-exemption-from-employee-insurance-requirement/', 'snippet': 'Many nursing home employees do not have health insurance — and will not, if nursing homes gain an exemption from the new health care law.', 'lead_paragr