ine collection of popular recorded music, monologues and more from the early decades of the 20th century. At the moment, the Jukebox includes more than 10,000 recordings on 78-r.p.m. discs made by the Victor Talking Machine Company from 1901 to 1925, but the library plans to expand the collection regularly. You can hear the opera star Enrico Caruso, Tin Pan Alley and Irving Berlin’s Broadway hits. The site enables you to create your own playlist. The collection also include hundreds of offensive, though historically significant, ethnic, religious and racial characterizations that come with a warning label. There is also a detailed explanation of the painstaking process of transferring these old discs into digital recordings.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Online 20th-Century Playlist From the Library of Congress', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Libraries and Librarians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berlin, Irving', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caruso, Enrico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Library of Congress', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-16T18:30:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/8cd4c4b4-b9eb-5ea0-b1e6-3fc4ca65a23b', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8cd4c4b4-b9eb-5ea0-b1e6-3fc4ca65a23b'}, {'abstract': 'Rahm Emanuel, who served as President Obama’s first White House chief of staff, completes latest his political transformation on Monday, taking office as the next mayor of Chicago.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/16/rhambo-no-more-call-him-mr-mayor/', 'snippet': 'Rahm Emanuel, who served as President Obama’s first White House chief of staff, completes latest his political transformation on Monday, taking office as the next mayor of Chicago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rahm Emanuel, who served as President Obama‘s first White House chief of staff, completes his latest political transformation on Monday, taking office as the next mayor of Chicago. Monica Davey, the Times’ Chicago bureau chief, gives a full rundown. Read more » ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rahmbo No More: Call Him ‘Mr. Mayor’', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Emanuel, Rahm', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-16T18:33:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/ccf9f112-930e-597b-954f-e28656750f25', 'word_count': 43, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ccf9f112-930e-597b-954f-e28656750f25'}, {'abstract': 'Haiti has come up with a plan to immunize 90 percent of its newborns by 2015, the Pan American Health Organization announced last week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/17/health/17global.html', 'snippet': 'Haiti has come up with a plan to immunize 90 percent of its newborns by 2015, the Pan American Health Organization announced last week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Haiti, which did a poor job of vaccinating its children even before the 2010 earthquake, has come up with a