beyond-the-melting-pot/', 'snippet': 'Part Chinatown, part Bollywood, cosmopolitan Kuala Lumpur is a blueprint for a new Asia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One evening last fall I was walking through Chinatown in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia, when, suddenly, in the midst of Cantonese restaurants, shops selling knockoff designer bags and food stalls hawking exotic-looking meats, I came across the wholly unexpected sight of a Hindu temple with a voluptuous gate tower: a riot of gilded idols and precious stones and wafts of thick incense.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beyond the Melting Pot', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-16T19:45:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By PANKAJ MISHRA', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pankaj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MISHRA', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/ae079d90-cd9f-545b-9d6d-8acf043b072e', 'word_count': 2685, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae079d90-cd9f-545b-9d6d-8acf043b072e'}, {'abstract': 'A new law envisions a 50 percent reduction in greenhouse gas emissions by 2025, despite the government’s austerity measures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/17/business/global/17carbon.html', 'snippet': 'A new law envisions a 50 percent reduction in greenhouse gas emissions by 2025, despite the government’s austerity measures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — Britain is poised to announce some of the world’s most ambitious goals for reducing greenhouse gas emissions — a striking example of a government committing to big environmental initiatives while also pursuing austerity measures.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'x