 songs by the composer Jerry Herman in her show “Herman on Herman ...With a Touch of Merman,” at the Metropolitan Room.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ur-show tunes belted by a brassy show-tune voice: that describes “Herman on Herman ...With a Touch of Merman,” the program of Jerry Herman songs being performed by Peggy Herman (she is not related to the composer) at the Metropolitan Room. The show, which has the distinction of being directed by Tommy Tune (with Peter Glebo), exemplifies a pep-for-pep’s-sake Broadway musical atavism. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/17/arts/PEGGY/PEGGY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 892, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/17/arts/PEGGY/PEGGY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/17/arts/PEGGY/PEGGY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tunes to Help Gray Skies Clear Up', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tunes to Help Gray Skies Clear Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Room', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Herman, Jerry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-16T20:58:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organizat