2343ab6f062', 'word_count': 490, 'uri': 'nyt://article/359f408b-29d3-5795-8d1f-32343ab6f062'}, {'abstract': 'Even without the reclusive Terrence Malick, there was plenty to talk about and gawk at the screening, news conference and afterparty for “The Tree of Life,” including a trippy movie and Brad Pitt and Angelina Jolie.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/17/scenes-from-a-cannes-gala/', 'snippet': 'Even without the reclusive Terrence Malick, there was plenty to talk about and gawk at the screening, news conference and afterparty for “The Tree of Life,” including a trippy movie and Brad Pitt and Angelina Jolie.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CANNES, France— As expected, Terrence Malick skipped the gala premiere of his film “The Tree of Life” on Monday night, but he was in town, according to a publicist for Fox Searchlight, which is releasing the film. He attended a cast dinner after the premiere, she said, but was apparently too shy for any public festivities. “He’s like a big teddy bear,” she said. “You just want to protect him.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scenes From a Cannes Gala', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cannes International Film Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jolie, Angelina', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Malick, Terrence', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pitt, Brad', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-17T14:15:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2611799-7dfa-5f95-a1