}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/437368c8-256d-5b80-bbe2-3e6d0a9c3879', 'word_count': 784, 'uri': 'nyt://article/437368c8-256d-5b80-bbe2-3e6d0a9c3879'}, {'abstract': 'The Muscular Dystrophy Association said its telethons have raised more than $1 billion and that Mr. Lewis has logged some 900 live hours of television as the program’s master of ceremonies.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/17/jerry-lewis-will-retire-from-labor-day-telethon/', 'snippet': 'The Muscular Dystrophy Association said its telethons have raised more than $1 billion and that Mr. Lewis has logged some 900 live hours of television as the program’s master of ceremonies.', 'lead_paragraph': "After 45 years as the spirited host of his annual Labor Day telethon to benefit the Muscular Dystrophy Association, Jerry Lewis said this year’s broadcast will be his last. “As a labor of love, I’ve hosted the annual Telethon since 1966,” Mr. Lewis said in a statement reported by The Associated Press, “and I’ll be making my final appearance on the show this year by performing my signature song, ‘You’ll Never Walk Alone.'”", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jerry Lewis Will Retire From Labor Day Telethon', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muscular Dystrophy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewis, Jerry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Muscular Dystrophy Assn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-17T14:37:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material':