rsjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/17/reviewing-gotham-bar-and-grill/', 'snippet': 'Photos of Gotham Bar and Grill, the classic American restaurant home to the chef Alfred Portale, which Sam Sifton reviews this week.', 'lead_paragraph': '\xa0', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reviewing Gotham Bar and Grill', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gotham Bar and Grill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Union Square (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-17T23:37:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/7429e7de-426b-5afb-a56f-7b485af30981', 'word_count': 300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7429e7de-426b-5afb-a56f-7b485af30981'}, {'abstract': 'One of New York’s fine-dining staples since 1984, the standards at Gotham have remained the same.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/18/dining/reviews/gotham-bar-and-grill-nyc-restaurant-review.html', 'snippet': 'One of New York’s fine-dining staples since 1984, the standards at Gotham have remained the same.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN a city obsessed with the shiny and novel, Gotham Bar and Grill is an outlier. Open since 1984, it celebrates stability and excellence, perhaps even opulence. Fabric chandeliers billow beneath soaring ceilings. Elaborate flowers are everywhere. People dress for dinner and are escorted past marvelous photographs on the way to their tables. It is all very civilized there.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'sou