orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/666ee184-4790-556a-8a5a-8bd765a21f7d', 'word_count': 458, 'uri': 'nyt://article/666ee184-4790-556a-8a5a-8bd765a21f7d'}, {'abstract': 'Tyler Seguin, Boston’s highly regarded rookie center, scored two goals and assisted on two others in a 6-5 victory over the Tampa Bay Lightning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/18/sports/hockey/seguins-breakout-night-helps-bruins-tie-series.html', 'snippet': 'Tyler Seguin, Boston’s highly regarded rookie center, scored two goals and assisted on two others in a 6-5 victory over the Tampa Bay Lightning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — The solution to what was ailing the Boston Bruins was right there in their dressing room all along: the highly regarded but underused 19-year-old rookie center, Tyler Seguin. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/18/sports/Y-BRUINS-2/Y-BRUINS-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 614, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/18/sports/Y-BRUINS-2/Y-BRUINS-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/18/sports/Y-BRUINS-2/Y-BRUINS-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Seguin’s Breakout Night Helps Bruins Tie Series', 'kicker': 'Bruins 6, Lightning 5', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rookie’s Breakout Game Helps Bruins Tie the Series', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tampa Bay Lightning', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam