ite.html', 'snippet': 'The Darby Downstairs, a lounge below the Darby supper club, leaves the bottle service and pretentiousness behind for a relaxed, intimate vibe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE Darby, a seven-month-old supper club that occupies the former Nell’s space, quietly opened a subterranean lounge in April, trying to recapture some of the spot’s old magic. Called the Darby Downstairs, the basement bar (with a separate entrance) is run by Richie Akiva, Ronnie Madra and Scott Sartiano — night-life veterans who operate Butter and 1Oak, which cater to bankers and models. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/19/fashion/Z-BOITE/Z-BOITE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/19/fashion/Z-BOITE/Z-BOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/19/fashion/Z-BOITE/Z-BOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Darby Downstairs', 'kicker': 'Boîte', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Darby Downstairs: West Village', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NIGHTCLUBS AND CABARETS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-18T17:36:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Vilensky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vilensky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization':