ner’s networks, TNT and TBS, would be on all but equal footing with the broadcast networks in the coming year.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/18/upfronts-turner-brings-new-series-to-tbs-and-tnt/', 'snippet': 'Turner Entertainment’s president told advertisers on Wednesday that Turner’s networks, TNT and TBS, would be on all but equal footing with the broadcast networks in the coming year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After joking his way (very effectively) through the technical glitches that plagued his company’s upfront presentation Wednesday morning, the Turner Entertainment president, Steve Koonin, urged advertisers to “stop leaving” the event and promised Turner’s networks, TNT and TBS, would be on all but equal footing with the broadcast networks in the coming year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Upfronts: Turner Brings New Series to TBS and TNT', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cable Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-18T20:10:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/ceec2309-a2b8-5c81-aa87-c992ac88f7bb', 'word_count': 284, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ceec2309-a2b8-5c81-aa87-c992ac88f7bb'}, {'abstract': 'T asked insiders from the surfing and design worlds to weigh in with their favorite surf spots.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/18/where-do-you-surf/', 'snippet': 'T asked insiders from the surfing and desig