ead_paragraph': 'For 15 years, the restaurateur Roy Liebenthal has been serving fast food in environments that are anything but off-the-cuff. Pop Burger and Pop Pizza, spaces created by the Turkish-born, Manhattan-based architect Ali Tayar, explored the layering of high-tech details with rough surfaces.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/19/garden/19rooms/Currents-7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 769, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/19/garden/19rooms/19rooms-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/19/garden/19rooms/19rooms-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Pop Pub, Deliberate Design for a Fast-Food Menu', 'kicker': 'Current | Rooms', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deliberate Design for a Fast-Food Menu', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tayar, Ali', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-18T22:37:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Fred A. Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Fred', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/26b9ad68-9aca-5999-b8c0-a0e6d69f74b2', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26b9ad68-9aca-5999-b8c0-a0e6d69f74b2'}, {'abstract': 'Dominique Strauss-Kahn’s bail application and related exhibits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2011/05/19/nyregion/20110519-Straus