, Krista F. McCary, with charges including criminal storage of a firearm and child neglect.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'California: Boy Accused in Killing of His Father Says He Was Abused', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | West', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'California: Boy Accused in Killing Of His Father Says He Was Abused', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Socialist Movement (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hall, Jeff', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-19T01:06:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse McKinley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/c1e94913-3f6a-571a-865e-5cf04cd45b0e', 'word_count': 153, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c1e94913-3f6a-571a-865e-5cf04cd45b0e'}, {'abstract': 'Dirk Nowitzki and the Dallas Mavericks are three games from advancing from the N.B.A. finals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/19/sports/basketball/nowitzki-and-the-mavericks-still-in-attack-mode-against-the-thunder.html', 'snippet': 'Dirk Nowitzki and the Dallas Mavericks are three games from advancing from the N.B.A. finals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DALLAS — Dirk Nowitzki emerged from the trainer’s room and bounded down a metal staircase Wednesday, remarkably fresh considering how he had dismantled the Oklahoma City Thunder only 18 hours earlier.', 'print_s