rts/basketball/the-heat-surges-late-and-gains-a-split-in-chicago.html', 'snippet': 'LeBron James scored nine of his 29 points in the fourth quarter and the Heat tied the series at 1-1 with a victory over Chicago Wednesday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — The bodies and jersey numbers did not need to change. That much, Erik Spoelstra and the Miami Heat insisted to anyone who would listen. This battle with the Bulls would not come down to personnel, but personality, and the Heat went in search of its own during a tedious two-day gap in the Eastern Conference finals.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/19/sports/19heat-2/19heat-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/19/sports/19heat-2/19heat-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/19/sports/19heat-2/19heat-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/19/sports/19heat-2/19heat-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/19/sports/19heat-2/19heat-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Heat Surges Late and Gains a Split in Chicago', 'kicker': 'Playoffs | Heat 85, Bulls 75', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Heat Gets Physical and Gets a Split', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Bulls', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wade, Dwyane', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-19T03:32:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Howard Beck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Howard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Beck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60c09c85-c9fe-51e8-b677-0e5a97048dce', 'word_count': 1003, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60c09c85-c9fe-51e8-b677-0e5a97048dce'}, {'abstract': 'Al Qaeda’s leader welcomed the uprisings in the Arab world in a recording made about a week before his death.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/19/world/middleeast/19binladen.html', 'snippet': 'Al Qaeda’s leader welcomed the uprisings in the Arab world in a recording made about a week before his death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a message to Muslims made public 16 days after his death, Osama bin Laden praised the pro-democracy uprisings that had swept the Arab world and, in the view of some experts, had called into question the relevance of Al Qaeda, the terrorist network he founded and led for 23 years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Message, Bin Laden Praised Arab Revolt', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Message, Bin Laden Praised Arab Revolt', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'b