rchangel-antiques/', 'snippet': 'Archangel Antiques is filled with buttons, jewelry, vintage clothing and other collectibles, and is overseen by a colorful store manager.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It would seem an almost impossible feat to stand out amid the clutter of Archangel Antiques, in the East Village, where tightly packed rails of vintage clothing vie for attention with glass cabinets lined with jewelry and curiosities. Yet the first thing most customers notice after descending to the subterranean entrance is Michael Duggan, who can usually be found sitting toward the back of the musty space, peering out from behind a pair of beige, 1950s tortoiseshell glasses.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Inventory of Curiosities, Tales Included', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Village (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-19T21:18:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Berger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/f79d2a0c-6d07-5126-8b01-3343ba92ad57', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f79d2a0c-6d07-5126-8b01-3343ba92ad57'}, {'abstract': 'The Danish filmmaker was banished from Cannes after remarks at a news conference.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/movies/danish-filmmaker-lars-von-trier-banished-at-cannes-film-festival.html', 'snippet': 'The Danish filmmaker was banished from Cannes after remarks at a news conference.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CANNES, France — The Danish filmmaker Lars von Trier has been a fixture at the Cannes Film Festival throughout his career. All but one of his features have had their premieres here, and he won the top prize, the Palme d’Or, in 2000 for “Dancer in the Dark.” But the longstanding relationship came to an abrupt halt on Thursday when the festival’s board of directors declared Mr. von Trier “persona non grata” a day after he joked at a news conference for his latest film, “Melancholia,” that he was a Nazi and sympathized with Hitler.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/LARS/LARS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/LARS/LARS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/LARS/LARS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/LARS/LARS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/LARS/LARS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Danish Director Barred From Festival After Making Hitler Jokes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Danish Director Barred From Festival After Making Hitler Jokes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Gathering of Jewish Holocaust Survivors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cannes International Film Festival', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'na