36-2000-54c7-a376-5c3a0483f82b', 'word_count': 1857, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a779d36-2000-54c7-a376-5c3a0483f82b'}, {'abstract': 'Officials in London say the Rwandan government may be plotting to kill two Rwandans in exile.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/world/africa/20rwanda.html', 'snippet': 'Officials in London say the Rwandan government may be plotting to kill two Rwandans in exile.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KAMPALA, Uganda — The British police have warned two outspoken Rwandan dissidents living in London that their lives are in danger because the Rwandan government may be plotting to kill them, according to British officials and documents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British Police Warn Rwandan Dissidents of Threat', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'London Police Warn Rwandan Dissidents of Threat From Their Government', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Scotland Yard (Metropolitan Police Service)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Torture', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rwanda', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-19T22:00:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Kron and Jeffrey Gettleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kron', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gettleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50d63c8a-253f-5775-af42-c37186000ed0', 'word_count': 878, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50d63c8a-253f-5775-af42-c37186000ed0'}, {'abstract': 'A shared passion for motorcycles and adventure are too much for this couple to pass up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/22/fashion/weddings/lisa-mullins-and-patrick-lassiter-vows.html', 'snippet': 'A shared passion for motorcycles and adventure are too much for this couple to pass up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOR Lisa Sasha Mullins, the best solution to any problem is a road trip on her motorcycle, a Harley Davidson she calls Tigerlily. Riding motorcycles is her “wind meditation,” she said, as well as her career. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/fashion/weddings/VOWS-2/VOWS-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/22/fashion/weddings/VOWS-2/VOWS-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/fashion/weddings/VOWS-2/VOWS-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/fashion/weddings/VOWS-2/VOWS-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/22/fashion/weddings/VOWS-2/VOWS-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sasha Mullins and Patrick Lassiter', 'kicker': 'Vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sasha Mullins and Patrick Lassiter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-19T22:01:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lois Smith Brady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lois', 'middlename': 'Smith', 'lastname': 'Brady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5780e2c-9fc4-5094-a61b-cbdd0886c5e3', 'word_count': 1176, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5780e2c-9fc4-5094-a61b-cbdd0886c5e3'}, {'abstract': 'Herkimer Street from Bedford to Nostrand Avenue in Bedford-Stuyvesant, Brooklyn, is an architecturally complex block.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/22/realestate/a-hike-down-herkimer-street-streetscapesbedford-stuyvesant.html', 'snippet': 'Herkimer Street from Bedford to Nostrand Avenue in Bedford-Stuyvesant, Brooklyn, is an architecturally complex block.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HERKIMER Street, from Bedford to Nostrand Avenue in Bedford-Stuyvesant, Brooklyn, is a perfect urban jumble: old frame houses smothered in aluminum siding; apartment buildings jammed in next to tiny brownstones; an empty mansion; a Baptist church in the Islamic style. It requires three or four passes (and a slide show online) to take in even half the details on this complex block.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/realestate/scapes-A/scapes-A-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/22/realestate/scapes-A/scapes-A-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}