ut that gets bodies in motion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’M suspicious of workouts that don’t give the same kind of cardio buzz that running and plyometrics do, and I often write off these so-called softer exercise routines as unchallenging. The Nalini Method, however, recently put me in my place. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/20Urban/SubUrban-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/20Urban/SubUrban-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/20Urban/SubUrban-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/20Urban/SubUrban-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/20/arts/20Urban/SubUrban-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Workout, Even for a Runner', 'kicker': 'Urban Athlete', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Workout, Even for a Runner', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-19T22:43:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shivani Vora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shivani', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vora', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'r