or being negotiated to stop planning until further notice. Governor Schwarzenegger is focusing on personal matters and is not willing to commit to any production schedules or timelines.” The hiatus will include “Cry Macho,” a movie that was expected to begin production in August. The Terminator franchise and all other projects under consideration are also on hold, Mr. Knapp said, adding: “We will resume discussions when Governor Schwarzenegger decides.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'California: Schwarzenegger Postpones Return to Film', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | WEST', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'California: Schwarzenegger Postpones Return to Film', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwarzenegger, Arnold', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADULTERY', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T00:45:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Medina', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Medina', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/3147553e-3f39-54cc-a0bb-ab710119fe2e', 'word_count': 136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3147553e-3f39-54cc-a0bb-ab710119fe2e'}, {'abstract': 'Tyler Hamilton told CBS that he saw Lance Armstrong inject himself with a performance-enhancing drug.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/sports/cycling/tyler-hamilton-ex-teammate-says-armstrong-used-banned-drug.html', 'snippet': 'Tyler Hamilton told CBS that he saw Lance Armstrong inject himself with a performance-enhancing drug.'