ed a turning point in a relationship that was not warm to begin with.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/world/middleeast/20policy.html', 'snippet': 'When they met Friday, President Obama and Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel faced a turning point in a relationship that was not warm to begin with.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel heads to the White House on Friday for the seventh meeting since President Obama took office, the two men are facing a turning point in a relationship that has never been warm. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama and Netanyahu, Distrustful Allies, Meet', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turning Point For 2 Leaders Lacking Trust', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Israeli Settlements', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T01:01:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helene Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02d07566-de64-572a-9fe5-03ba43c5758a', 'word_count': 1109, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02d07566-de64-572a-9fe5-03ba43c5758a'}, {'abstract': 'After spending 16 days in the majors, in two stints, Noesi was summoned in the 12th inning of a 1-1 game, securing him his first career win, in his first career game.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/19/a-memorable-debut-for-hector-noesi/', 'snippet': 'After spending 16 days in the majors, in two stints, Noesi was summoned in the 12th inning of a 1-1 game, securing him his first career win, in his first career game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hector Noesi’s two children had been long asleep by the time their father made his major league debut Wednesday night, pitching four scoreless innings in the Yankees’ 4-1 victory. But when Yeudri, his 5-year-old son, woke up and heard that Noesi had finally pitched, he had but one question: “Did my daddy win the game?” Noesi recounted that story Thursday afternoon, when he was still trying to process his good fortune.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Memorable Debut for Hector Noesi', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Concussions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T01:02:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3316c19-a4af-5997-82a3-b72296c743d5', 'word_count': 499, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3316c19-a4af-5997-82a3-b72296c743d5'}, {'abstract': 'Manufacturing is one of the bright spots of a generally disappointing recovery. Just look at the auto industry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/opinion/20kru