_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/243b1df1-40c0-525f-8d59-163edc273fca', 'word_count': 1016, 'uri': 'nyt://article/243b1df1-40c0-525f-8d59-163edc273fca'}, {'abstract': 'John Shirreffs misses Zenyatta, a horse for the ages, but he is optimistic about Mr. Commons, who will run in the Preakness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/sports/mr-commons-gives-hope-to-zenyattas-trainer-in-preakness.html', 'snippet': 'John Shirreffs misses Zenyatta, a horse for the ages, but he is optimistic about Mr. Commons, who will run in the Preakness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — Zenyatta’s stall at Hollywood Park remains empty except for a few portraits of her drawn by her fans. She is at Lane’s End farm in Kentucky working on becoming a broodmare. Her trainer, John Shirreffs, is here at Pimlico for the 136th running of the Preakness Stakes on Saturday with a pretty good colt named Mr. Commons.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/20/sports/Y-JP-PREAKNESS/Y-JP-PREAKNESS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/20/sports/Y-JP-PREAKNESS/Y-JP-PREAKNESS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/20/sports/Y-JP-PREAKNESS/Y-JP-PREAKNESS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Zenyatta’s Trainer Uncovers a Colt That Gives Him Hope', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Zenyatta’s Trainer Uncovers a Colt That Gives Him Hope', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jockeys, Drivers and Trainers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subj