age in the New York Times of its day.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/19/way-back-machine-doomsday-east-patchogue-1925/', 'snippet': 'Eighty-six years ago, New York had its very own prophet of the apocalypse, Robert Reidt, who earned derisive front page coverage in the New York Times of its day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Almost since the moment the ink dried on the Book of Revelation, seers and scriptural interpreters have been announcing the precise date and time at which the faithful would be whisked off to heaven and those left behind abandoned to immediate and unpleasant annihilation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Way Back Machine | Doomsday, East Patchogue, 1925', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T01:38:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/5390976b-58a4-5b05-8af5-4e7327afd9f9', 'word_count': 857, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5390976b-58a4-5b05-8af5-4e7327afd9f9'}, {'abstract': 'A report leaves no doubt about Massey Energy’s responsibility for the mining disaster.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/opinion/20fri2.html', 'snippet': 'A report leaves no doubt about Massey Energy’s responsibility for the mining disaster.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An inquiry by the state of West Virginia into the Upper Big Branch Mine explosion that killed 29 workers has found the mine’s owner, Massey Energy, “profoundly reckless” in elevating its drive to produce profits above worker safety. Pervasive safety violations — from shoddy ventilation to slapdash control of explosive coal dust — made the mine “an accident waiting to happen,” according to a panel of experts reporting to the governor’s office. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Truth About Upper Big Branch', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Truth About Upper Big Branch: A report leaves no doubt about Massey Energy’s responsibility for the mining disaster', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Upper Big Branch Mine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Massey Energy Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coal', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Virginia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T01:38:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/d647f9f3-e1e2-5510-ad37-1fa62c72cf58', 'word_count': 338, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d647f9f3-e1e2-5510-ad37-1fa62c72cf58'}, {'abstract': 'Now with the Orioles as Buck Showalter’s bench coach, Willie Randolph yearns for a second chance at managing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/sports/baseball/willie-randolph-wants-another-crack-at-managing.html', 'snippet': 'Now with the Orioles as Buck Showalter’s bench coach, Willie Randolph yearns for a second chance at managing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/20/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 