hearsal studio. Now, the building has been cited for violations, and they are being evicted.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/22/nyregion/the-last-jam-session-at-106-rivington.html', 'snippet': 'For decades, musicians have used a dank basement on the Lower East Side as a rehearsal studio. Now, the building has been cited for violations, and they are being evicted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IGNORE the splintered banisters leading up the stoop at 106 Rivington Street. Instead, go down the four steps on the right, push through the graffiti-marked metal door into the basement and gird yourself against the rank smell — a perfumed mix of sweat and soaked carpet.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22PRACTISE1/22PRACTISE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22PRACTISE1/22PRACTISE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22PRACTISE1/22PRACTISE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22PRACTISE1/22PRACTISE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22PRACTISE1/22PRACTISE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Last Jam Session', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Last Jam Session', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evictions', 'rank': 