walking on hot coals, twisting his mustache into four curlicues and swimming in subzero temperatures, had become the stuff of Coney Island mythology.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Coney Island, he was known as “the rabbi.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Coney I. Bids Farewell to the Rabbi of the Beach', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CONEY ISLAND POLAR BEARS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'CONEY ISLAND (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T16:35:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Stelloh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelloh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a99d81a-53b2-5c7a-a1d7-07a2161e7991', 'word_count': 725, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a99d81a-53b2-5c7a-a1d7-07a2161e7991'}, {'abstract': 'How LinkedIn compares to other big Internet names like Facebook and Google.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/valuing-linkedin-and-social-networking/', 'snippet': 'How LinkedIn compares to other big Internet names like Facebook and Google.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the fervor for LinkedIn continues, analysts, investors and reporters are asking: Is there another bubble?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Valuing LinkedIn and Social Networking', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook.com', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank'