ade a number of noteworthy recent additions: new columns, new sections and new writers. Among the new contributing writers is Alex Pappademas, who’ll be reporting regularly for us on popular culture (as well, we hope, on an array of other subjects). To experience firsthand Alex’s Rumplestiltskinian ability to spin magical gold from apparent cultural dross — and to see just why we’re so excited to have him here — read his excellent GQ profile of Mike Sorrentino, a k a the Situation, the star of “Jersey Shore.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Every Generation Needs Its Howl', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T16:58:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Sternbergh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sternbergh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d34c7fc-e127-56fb-9bc5-4eb87ead5785', 'word_count': 510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d34c7fc-e127-56fb-9bc5-4eb87ead5785'}, {'abstract': 'Israeli officials told reporters on Friday that President Obama “does not understand the reality in the Mideast.”', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/netanyahu-to-confront-obama-with-reality-israelis-say/', 'snippet': 'Israeli officials told reporters on Friday that President Obama “does not understand the reality in the Mideast.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even as he flew to Washington for talks at the White House on Friday, Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu continued to signal his anger with President Obama’s statement on Thursday that “the borders of Israel and Palestine should be based on the 1967 lines with mutually agreed swaps.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [],