': 'Obama Thanks the C.I.A. for Hunting Down Bin Laden', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Thanks the C.I.A. for Hunting Down Bin Laden', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Intelligence Services', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Intelligence Agency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T23:05:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Mazzetti', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mazzetti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc5ff750-5d46-551f-996e-7662be20e603', 'word_count': 416, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc5ff750-5d46-551f-996e-7662be20e603'}, {'abstract': 'The would-be terrorists in Zack Russell’s satiric comedy “Just Cause” are actually middle-class Brooklynites in their 20s, with no cause, no ideology and no jobs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/21/theater/reviews/zack-russells-just-cause-at-the-flea-theater-review.html', 'snippet': 'The would-be terrorists in Zack Russell’s satiric comedy “Just Cause” are actually middle-class Brooklynites in their 20s, with no cause, no ideology and no jobs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The bubble-headed terrorists of Zack Russell’s satiric comedy “Just Cause” at the Flea Theater have no cause, just or otherwise, and no ideology. That’s Mr. Russell’s point. About the only thing they respond to is a slogan as lazy as they are: “Freedom comes to those who love it.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The 