sday has been dominated by talk of his rambling comments about Nazism at a news conference and his subsequent expulsion from the festival.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/Lars/Lars-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/Lars/Lars-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/Lars/Lars-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/Lars/Lars-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/Lars/Lars-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Derailed Director Cites Urge to Entertain', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Derailed Director Cites Urge to Entertain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cannes International Film Festival', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'von Trier, Lars', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T23:19:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Lim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c942140-958f-57af-9c17-773c3403f91c', 'word_count': 1233, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c942140-958f-57af-9c17-773c3403f91c'}, {'abstract': 'An exhibition at the New York Botanical Garden is an homage to the meditative pleasures of the Alhambra’s gardens.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/21/arts/design/spanish-paradise-gardens-of-the-alhambra-at-the-new-york-botanical-garden-review.html', 'snippet': 'An exhibition at the New York Botanical Garden is an homage to the meditative pleasures of the Alhambra’s gardens.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The smell I remember. It was sensuous and sweet in the early summer morning but also airy, light, with an almost spicy edge. And it shifted character as I walked past the murmuring fountains and groomed myrtle bushes. But I didn’t pay much attention. Eight years ago there were other impressions to attend to, made by the honeycombed ceilings and ornamented stucco, the interweaving geometries on tiles and stone, the views of tall cypresses and corrugated rooftops. The place, in uniting opposites, seemed to insist on a mythical significance as fortress and pleasure garden, a seat of power and a meditative retreat: the Alhambra. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/alhambra/alhambra-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 346, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/alhambra/alhambra-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 346}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/alhambra/alhambra-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 585, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/alhambra/alhambra-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/21/arts/alhambra/alhambra-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Temptations Found in Gardens of Islamic Delight', 'kicker': 'Exhibition Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Temptations Found in Gardens Of Islamic Delight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gardens and Gardening', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Botanical Garden', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-20T23:20:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Rothstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/248c1e1e-4edc-5057-bcbe-7f0cfb76eb02', 'word_count': 1500, 'uri': 'nyt://article/248c1e1e-4edc-5057-bcbe-7f0cfb76eb02'}, {'abstract': 'A look at all major events on the International Ice Hockey Federation calendar shows how the top federations performed over all.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/u-s-finish-at-worlds-does-not-reflect-overall-program/', 'snippet': 'A look at all major events on the International Ice Hockey Federation calendar shows how the top federations performed over all.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Although the N.H.L. playoffs are continuing at breakneck speed, the international hockey season officially ended last week with the gold medal game of the 75th world championship.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Finish at Worlds Does Not Reflect Overall Program', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '',