': 'Students with learning and social disabilities are being taught to row on the Harlem River, gaining a whole new attitude with each stroke.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/22/nyregion/students-tap-power-of-rowing-on-the-harlem-river.html', 'snippet': 'Students with learning and social disabilities are being taught to row on the Harlem River, gaining a whole new attitude with each stroke.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I’M bored,” announced Shlomo Orenstein, 14, a seventh grader from Brooklyn, as he lay on a floating dock on the Harlem River on Thursday, picking splinters out of the wooden planks with his idle hands.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22SWEAT2/22SWEAT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22SWEAT2/22SWEAT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22SWEAT2/22SWEAT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22SWEAT2/22SWEAT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/22/nyregion/22SWEAT2/22SWEAT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Through Rowing, New Confidence', 'kicker': 'Sweat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Through Rowing, New Confidence', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rowing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': '