xpected to miss a Los Angeles Galaxy game to attend to “business” in England.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/20/beckham-a-go-go/', 'snippet': 'David Beckham is again expected to miss a Los Angeles Galaxy game to attend to “business” in England.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Somewhere in Los Angeles, in a corner of his house perhaps near where he stows his golf clubs, Galaxy Coach Bruce Arena must be sticking pins in his David Beckham doll and hoping for a quick end to the Beckham experiment, which has turned into a frantic dance as Becks juggles his social calendar among his myriad interests, and the Galaxy, too.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beckham-a-Go-Go', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARENA, BRUCE', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beckham, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Soccer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester United', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-21T00:18:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf234b5e-5647-5542-adbb-75739fff5bc2', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf234b5e-5647-5542-adbb-75739fff5bc2'}, {'abstract': 'One of three finalists in the White House’s 2011 Race to the Top High School Commencement Challenge had hoped for a graduation speech delivered by the president himself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/21/us/politics/21bridg