ogies that power modern society.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jack Keil Wolf, an engineer and computer theorist whose mathematical reasoning about how best to transmit and store information helped shape the digital innards of computers and other devices that power modern society, died on May 12 at his home in the La Jolla section of San Diego. He was 76.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/21/business/WOLF-obit/WOLF-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/21/business/WOLF-obit/WOLF-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jack Wolf, Who Did the Math Behind Computers, Dies at 76', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jack K. Wolf, 76, Who Did The Math Behind Computers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Data Storage', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of California, San Diego', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Engineering and Engineers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-21T00:35:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/5513fafb-fed6-50a3-b6d6-f16a634ccb39', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5513fafb-fed6-50a3-b6d6-f16a634ccb39'}, {'abstract': 'Avventura, originally a grocery store, has become a delicatessen offering a diverse menu of to-go items, and a pastry shop.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/22/nyregion/avventura-went-from-grocery-to-deli-and-pastry-shop.html', 'snippet': 'Avventura, originally a grocery store, has become a delicatessen offering a diverse menu of to-go items, and a pastry shop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Rosario Minnocci opened Avventura in 1990, it was an all-purpose neighborhood grocery, much like any across the state. A decade later, the store is a first-rate delicatessen and pastry shop — a result of Mr. Minnocci’s decision to concentrate on house-made foods and pastries. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corned Beef and Cannoli', 'kicker': 'Quick Bite | Waterbury', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corned Beef and Cannoli', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Delicatessens', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-21T00:36:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Brooks', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brooks', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53d45fbf-a089-57a2-8c89-0cb97344ea39', 'word_count': 301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53d45fbf-a089-57a2-8c89-0cb97344ea39'}, {'abstract': 'An explosion and fire at a Foxconn Technology plant in China that makes Apple and Dell products killed two people and injured 16.', 'web_url