This Is Not a Film,” which was smuggled to France on an USB thumb drive that was hidden inside a cake.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CANNES, France— Film festivals around the world have reacted to the arrest, banning and conviction of the Iranian filmmaker Jafar Panahi with official statements, special screenings and gestures of solidarity — at the Berlin Film Festival earlier this year, a seat was left empty for Mr. Panahi at every screening in the main venue. But the most meaningful act of all may be the Cannes Film Festival’s decision — announced just days before screenings got under way — to show new films that Mr. Panahi and his countryman Mohammed Rasoulof had made in defiance of their bans. (Like Mr. Panahi, Mr. Rasoulof, whose new film, “Goodbye,” is about an Iranian woman trying to leave the country, has been convicted for collusion against the regime — both were given six-year prison sentences, which are being appealed.) ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cannes Q. and A.: The Loneliness of the Banned Filmmaker', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cannes International Film Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Panahi, Jafar', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-21T18:31:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Lim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/fcb3bfd6-7bf5-5492-9aee-89075e603d28', 'word_count': 951, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fcb3bfd6-7bf5-5492-9aee-89075e603d28'}, {'abstract': 'Winter snows piled up on mountain ranges throughout the West will now melt — mildly if weather conditions are just right, catastrophically if they are not.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/22/us/22snow.html', 'snippet': 'Winter snows piled up on mountain ranges throughout the West will now melt — mildly if weather conditions are just right, catastrophically if they are not.', 'lead_paragraph': 'STEAMBOAT SPRINGS, Colo. — For all the attention on epic flooding in the Mississippi Valley, a quiet threat has been growing here in the West where winter snows have piled up on mountain ranges throughout the region.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22snow-span/22snow-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 326, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22snow-span/22snow-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 326}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22snow-span/SNOW-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22snow-span/22snow-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22snow-span/22snow-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Record Snowpacks Could Threaten Western States', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Record Snowpacks Could Pose Threat To Western States', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Western States (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Floods', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'ra