entists at Fermilab in Batavia plan to narrow their focus to less expensive experiments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When scientists at the Fermi National Accelerator Laboratory announced last month that they might have discovered a new elementary particle or fundamental force of nature, it was likely the swan song of the lab’s Tevatron accelerator, once the most powerful atom-smasher in the world.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22CNCFERMI1/22CNCFERMI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22CNCFERMI1/22CNCFERMI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22CNCFERMI1/22CNCFERMI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22CNCFERMI1/22CNCFERMI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/22/us/22CNCFERMI1/22CNCFERMI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Atom-Smasher Retires; Lab Makes Career Switch', 'kicker': 'Chicago News Cooperative', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Atom-Smasher Retires; Lab Makes Career Switch', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fermi National Accelerator Laboratory', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Large Hadron Collider', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Neutrinos', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Particle Accelerators', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Science and Technology', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-21T21:14:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Lipkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lipkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fabb08f-97af-5b38-9e4f-3202086a9444', 'word_count': 686, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fabb08f-97af-5b38-9e4f-3202086a9444'}, {'abstract': 'The sexually explicit videos were posted on a Web site that has cast itself as part of a breakaway ultranationalist group.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/22/world/europe/22turkey.html', 'snippet': 'The sexually explicit videos were posted on a Web site that has cast itself as part of a breakaway ultranationalist group.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISTANBUL — Just weeks before general elections in Turkey, six leading members of an opposition party were forced to resign from Parliament on Saturday after sexually explicit videos of one of them were posted on the Internet.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Online Sex Videos Force Resignations of Six Members of Turkish Opposition Party', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Online Sex Videos Force Resignations of Six Members of Turkish Opposition Party', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Indecency, Obscenity and Profanity', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-21T21:14:50+0