act': 'New York City Opera’s announcement of its departure from Lincoln Center was not exactly a triumphant declaration of independence; the company will need a clear sense of purpose to move forward successfully.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/23/arts/music/city-opera-move-is-still-hazy-but-rife-with-potential.html', 'snippet': 'New York City Opera’s announcement of its departure from Lincoln Center was not exactly a triumphant declaration of independence; the company will need a clear sense of purpose to move forward successfully.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After talking, fantasizing and plotting about it for years, New York City Opera is moving out of Lincoln Center. Immediately! Or so the company said on Friday in a stunning, if very sketchy, announcement from George Steel, the general manager and artistic director. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/23/arts/JPOPERA1/JPOPERA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/23/arts/JPOPERA1/JPOPERA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/23/arts/JPOPERA1/JPOPERA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Move by City Opera Has Potential, as Well as Possible Pitfalls', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Move by City Opera Has Potential, as Well as Possible Pitfalls', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York City Opera', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-22T17:07:44+0000', 'document