'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/db60f963-800b-5a2f-85c7-299079e31f21', 'word_count': 280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db60f963-800b-5a2f-85c7-299079e31f21'}, {'abstract': 'A rash of suicides at South Korea’s most prestigious university highlights a generation of students awash in unhappiness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/23/world/asia/23southkorea.html', 'snippet': 'A rash of suicides at South Korea’s most prestigious university highlights a generation of students awash in unhappiness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAEJEON, South Korea — It has been a sad and gruesome semester at South Korea’s most prestigious university, and with final exams beginning Monday the school is still reeling from the recent suicides of four students and a popular professor. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/23/business/SOUTH-KOREA/SOUTH-KOREA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/23/business/SOUTH-KOREA/SOUTH-KOREA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/23/business/SOUTH-KOREA/SOUTH-KOREA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/23/business/SOUTH-KOREA/SOUTH-KOREA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/23/business/SOUTH-KOREA/SOUTH-KOREA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Elite South Korean University Rattled by Suicides', 'kicker': 'Memo From South K