rk Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Class Gets Acquainted Months Before Freshman Fall', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-23T15:18:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Caren Osten Gerszberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Caren', 'middlename': 'Osten', 'lastname': 'Gerszberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/0dccef8e-0ff5-5c00-9584-274264bf69b6', 'word_count': 798, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0dccef8e-0ff5-5c00-9584-274264bf69b6'}, {'abstract': 'The 19th season of Encores! at New York City Center will open on Feb. 8 with a revival of “Merrily We Roll Along” directed by James Lapine, followed by new productions of “Pipe Dream” and “Gentlemen Prefer Blondes.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/23/merrily-pipe-dream-and-blondes-are-on-for-new-encores-season/', 'snippet': 'The 19th season of Encores! at New York City Center will open on Feb. 8 with a revival of “Merrily We Roll Along” directed by James Lapine, followed by new productions of “Pipe Dream” and “Gentlemen Prefer Blondes.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The telephones, intercoms, typewriters and piano keys of Franklin Shepard Inc. will soon be ringing, buzzing and tapping away again in a revival of “Merrily We Roll Along” that James Lapine will direct for the 19th season of New York City Center’s Encores! program, press representatives for the musical-revival series said on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Merrily,’ ‘Pipe Dream’ and ‘Blondes’ Are On for New Encores! Season', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Encores! Great 