 on Saturday at Pimlico:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Animal Kingdom: Anatomy of Getting Close', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Preakness Stakes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-23T19:00:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1d6b40f-5db5-54f4-a642-7e4b692da52f', 'word_count': 208, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1d6b40f-5db5-54f4-a642-7e4b692da52f'}, {'abstract': 'Electronic tools can help you bargain for a car in a tight market.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/23/tools-to-negotiate-car-deals-in-a-tough-market/', 'snippet': 'Electronic tools can help you bargain for a car in a tight market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As you may have read, this isn’t expected to be a great summer to buy a car, whether you’re looking to buy new or used.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tools to Negotiate Car Deals in a Tough Market', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Edmunds.com', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-23T19:01:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/f87f0afe-84fe-57ae-9929-4b98b337b722', 'word_count': 346, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f87f0afe-84fe-57ae-9929-4b98b337b722'}, {'abstract': 'Despite weak economic conditions, sales of organic foods in the United States and Europe are growing, and investors have noticed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/24/business/global/24organic.html', 'snippet': 'Despite weak economic conditions, sales of organic foods in the United States and Europe are growing, and investors have noticed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Even during a period of rising food prices and economic uncertainty, Damien Bignon, a poultry farmer in the Paris region, cannot meet the demand from local markets and stores for his organic eggs.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/business/Organic1/Organic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/24/business/Organic1/Organic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/business/Organic1/Organic1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/business/Organic1/Organic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/24/business/Organic1/Organic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Strong Sales of Organic Foods Attract Investors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Strong Sales Of Organic Foods Attract Investors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 's