 create population projections that can be compared and analyzed. They also delve into related questions about resources and supplies with respect to projected population growth. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'By the Billions: Creating and Comparing Population Growth Projections', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Census', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Population', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-23T19:11:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Honner and Holly Epstein Ojalvo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Honner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Holly', 'middlename': 'Epstein', 'lastname': 'Ojalvo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://article/e75413d7-be16-5bfd-834e-2fdf467826ad', 'word_count': 1936, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e75413d7-be16-5bfd-834e-2fdf467826ad'}, {'abstract': 'The United States roster for next month’s Concacaf Gold Cup was announced on Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/23/u-s-unveils-gold-cup-roster/', 'snippet': 'The United States roster for next month’s Concacaf Gold Cup was announced on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bob Bradley, the coach of the United States national team, released his 23-man roster for next month’s friendly match against Spain and for the Concacaf Gold Cup tournament. Perhaps the biggest surprise was the inclusion of Freddy Adu.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Unveils Gold Cup Roster', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'n