t inside a heavily guarded area.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/24/world/asia/24afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'Two days after a deadly attack on a Kabul hospital, there are five arrests and some answers on how a suicide bomber got inside a heavily guarded area.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — A Pakistani wore the vest rigged with explosives; a Kabul University medical student did the planning. And a soldier new to the Afghan Army — promised 25,000 Pakistan rupees, about $290, for his trouble — provided the vital military uniform that made possible the attack here Saturday on the grounds of the national military hospital.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/world/24afghanistan-inline1/24afghanistan-inline1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/world/24afghanistan-inline1/24afghanistan-inline1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/24/world/24afghanistan-inline1/24afghanistan-inline1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Five Arrests in Attack on Hospital in Kabul', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Five Arrests In Attack On Hospital In Kabul', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kabul (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-23T20:06:00+0000', 'd