 Frelinghuysen served more than two decades in the House of Representatives and was a member of a New Jersey family that has produced four United States Senators', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/24/nyregion/peter-frelinghuysen-jr-95-longtime-nj-congressman-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Frelinghuysen served more than two decades in the House of Representatives and was a member of a New Jersey family that has produced four United States Senators', 'lead_paragraph': 'Peter H. B. Frelinghuysen Jr., one in a long line of family members to represent New Jersey in Congress and a leader in the successful fight to block an airport proposed for the state’s Great Swamp wildlife area, died on Monday at his home in Harding Township, N.J. He was 95.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/nyregion/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 344, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/24/nyregion/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 344}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/nyregion/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/nyregion/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/24/nyregion/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit/FRELINGHUYSEN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Peter Frelinghuysen Jr., 95, Former Congressman, Dies',