//article/d784c1ba-b10d-5291-9a88-3a657066954e'}, {'abstract': 'Taj Smith of the Indianapolis Colts is one of the fringe players, with only a few years of experience, left in limbo by the N.F.L.’s lockout.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/24/sports/football/visions-of-the-past-propel-colts-taj-smith-forward.html', 'snippet': 'Taj Smith of the Indianapolis Colts is one of the fringe players, with only a few years of experience, left in limbo by the N.F.L.’s lockout.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWARK — Bernadine Smith raised eight children here, five boys and three girls, 13 years separating the oldest from the youngest. Her boys were inseparable, and she tried to keep them together, keep them home, with board games and cooking lessons and movie nights. “If I could have kept my kids in a bubble,” she said, “I would have.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/sports/TAJ1/TAJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 346, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/24/sports/TAJ1/TAJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 346}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/sports/TAJ1/TAJ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/sports/TAJ1/TAJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/24/sports/TAJ1/TAJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Visions of the Past Propel a Man Forward', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Visions of the Past P