ternatives to shuttering firehouses and laying off teachers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/24/nyregion/critics-of-bloombergs-budget-offer-other-ideas.html', 'snippet': 'With five weeks until a deadline for passing a budget, City Council members, community activists and interest groups are offering alternatives to shuttering firehouses and laying off teachers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg, facing a reduction in state and federal aid and a rise in city costs, has said that balancing New York’s budget will require shuttering 20 firehouses and laying off 4,100 teachers. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/24/nyregion/BUDGETIDEAS1/BUDGETIDEAS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 612, 'width': 471, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Critics of the Mayor’s Budget Put Forth Their Own Ideas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Critics of the Mayor’s Budget Put Forth Their Own Ideas', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Federation of Teachers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mulgrew, Michael', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stringer, Scott M', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-24T01:57:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Me