emming from the Dodd-Frank Act until September 2012, more than two years after the law was enacted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A House panel approved a plan on Tuesday to delay several rules for the $600 trillion derivatives market, a leading player in the financial crisis. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'G.O.P. Lawmakers Vote to Delay Derivatives Rules', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Derivatives (Financial Instruments)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (2010)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachus, Spencer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frank, Barney', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Commodity Futures Trading Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House Financial Services Committee', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-24T21:46:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e3fb9cf-9b18-5d12-afbd-10444a87c456', 'word_count': 509, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e3fb9cf-9b18-5d12-afbd-10444a87c456'}, {'abstract': 'American Ballet Theater continues to attract global stars, including Alina Cojocaru, Natalia Osipova, Polina Semionova and Diana Vishneva.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/25/arts/dance/american-ballet-theater-hosts-alina-cojocaru-review.html', 'snippet': 'American Ballet Theater continues to attract global stars, including Alina Cojocaru, Natalia Osipova, Polina Semionova and Diana Vishneva.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What does American Ballet Theater do better than other companies? Does it have the world’s best selection of male principal dancers? Does it have in Alexei Ratmansky the world’s best full-time ballet choreographer of the day? About these points we can argue. But when it comes to a choice of global guest stars, all dispute fades: Ballet Theater is in a class of its own. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/25/arts/ABT1/ABT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 317, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/25/arts/ABT1/ABT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 317}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/25/arts/ABT1/ABT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 434, 'width': 807, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/25/arts/ABT1/ABT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/25/arts/ABT1/ABT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ballet’s Home Away From Home for International Stars in New York', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ballet’s Home Away From Home for International Stars in New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN BALLET THEATER', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-24T21:46:38+0000', 'document_ty