se: setting off a nuclear weapon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/25/world/middleeast/25iran.html', 'snippet': 'The International Atomic Energy Agency said it has evidence that Tehran has conducted work on a technology that could be used for only one purpose: setting off a nuclear weapon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The world’s global nuclear inspection agency, frustrated by Iran’s refusal to answer questions, revealed for the first time on Tuesday that it possesses evidence that Tehran has conducted work on a highly sophisticated nuclear triggering technology that experts said could be used for only one purpose: setting off a nuclear weapon.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/25/world/IRAN-2/IRAN-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 700, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/25/world/IRAN-2/IRAN-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/25/world/IRAN-2/IRAN-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Watchdog Finds Evidence That Iran Worked on Nuclear Triggers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Watchdog Finds Evidence That Iran Worked on Nuclear Triggers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Energy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Atomic Energy Agency', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subjec