ley masterminded and free agency built, is one win away from the N.B.A. finals after defeating Chicago in five grueling quarters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/25/sports/basketball/heats-superstars-grind-out-a-win.html', 'snippet': 'Miami, the team that Pat Riley masterminded and free agency built, is one win away from the N.B.A. finals after defeating Chicago in five grueling quarters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — Shots were blocked, basketballs clanked off rims and turnovers abounded, testing the egos of the superstars who dotted the floor of American Airlines Arena on Tuesday night. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/25/sports/finalHEAT1/finalHEAT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 752, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Heat’s Superstars Grind Out a Win', 'kicker': 'Playoffs | Heat 101, Bulls 93 (OT)', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Miami’s Superstars Grind Out a Win', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bosh, Chris', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Bulls', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wade, Dwyane', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-25T04:45:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Abrams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abrams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'r