des about the role of government. It appears to make a difference in academic grading, too, a new study finds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The divide between liberals and conservatives applies to more than just attitudes about the role of government. It appears to make a difference in university grading, too.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Grading on a Partisan Curve', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grading of Students', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-25T16:30:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cca85c47-c9ae-53eb-858c-10b032f5efc1', 'word_count': 435, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cca85c47-c9ae-53eb-858c-10b032f5efc1'}, {'abstract': 'It’s looking clearer by the day.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/25/third-depression-watch/', 'snippet': 'It’s looking clearer by the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year I warned that we seemed to be heading into the “Third Depression” — by which I meant a prolonged period of economic weakness:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Third Depression Watch', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-25T16:31:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'mi