amed ligament in his right elbow. Soriano was examined Wednesday by the renowned orthopedist Dr. James Andrews, who recommended rest for the next two weeks before beginning a conservative throwing program. General Manager Brian Cashman said the Yankees hope that Soriano can face hitters four to six weeks after that, which would place his potential return around the All-Star game, which is July 12.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Elbow to Sideline Soriano for Six to Eight Weeks', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cashman, Brian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Soriano, Rafael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-25T20:52:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee3cd487-0729-5c8f-ac27-36401f6b4bfb', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee3cd487-0729-5c8f-ac27-36401f6b4bfb'}, {'abstract': 'Citing the military’s own acknowledgement of climate change as a national security threat, critics call on Congress to reject the proposal.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/25/bill-allows-military-to-use-high-carbon-liquid-coal/', 'snippet': 'Citing the military’s own acknowledgement of climate change as a national security threat, critics call on Congress to reject the proposal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An amendment to a major military spending bill before the House would rescind a 2007 federal law barring the Defense Department from using alternative fuels, like synthetic oil made from coal, that produce more climate-altering pollution than conventional fuels.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Allows Military to Use High-Carbon ‘Liquid Coal’', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Biofuels', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weiss, Daniel J', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-25T20:53:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Collins Rudolf', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': 'Collins', 'lastname': 'Rudolf', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ce36669-e6af-5e56-914b-bc912255e084', 'word_count': 490, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ce36669-e6af-5e56-914b-bc912255e084'}, {'abstract': 'Mompou’s “Musica Callada” in a new CD by Jenny Lin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/arts/music/new-on-cd-mompous-musica-callada-jenny-lin.html', 'snippet': 'Mompou’s “Musica Callada” in a new CD by Jenny Lin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOMPOU: ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/arts/CD-REVIEWS-2/CD-REVIEWS-2-jumbo.jpg', 'he