estions over setting the thermostat in a kind of middle-aged commune.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WE would meet in the kitchen just after sunrise each morning — he in his white terry robe, I in my black embroidered caftan. We would talk groggily while making coffee — he meticulously nursing a drip cone over a single mug, I stoking up the automatic for a tub of caffeine.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/26/garden/26domestic/Domestic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/26/garden/26domestic/26domestic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/26/garden/26domestic/26domestic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Collegiate Living: Honeys, I’m Home', 'kicker': 'Domestic Lives', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Collegiate Living: Honeys, I’m Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Harvard University', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Housing and Real Estate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-25T22:35:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Leigh Brown', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': 'Leigh', 'lastname': 'Brown', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a9749862-cc56-5dad-9600-14269b48d1ae', 'word_count': 1306, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a9749862-cc56-5dad-9600-14269b48d1ae'}, {'abst