e. No big deal for me, as the media can still get the job done. But the team members who have been going without sleep for 60 hours — as one said to me — really have it hard. All the time I was sleeping and writing my previews in the comfort of the trains from Barcelona to Monaco, these people were deconstructing, transporting and reconstructing the massive motor homes between the Barcelona paddock on Sunday to here today.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'First Day in Monaco, Sunshine and Shadows', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Monaco Grand Prix', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Button, Jenson', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumacher, Michael', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trulli, Jarno', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Formula One', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Monaco', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T01:30:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brad Spurgeon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Spurgeon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/974008fd-3839-5289-898f-a5b968ffa4f5', 'word_count': 485, 'uri': 'nyt://article/974008fd-3839-5289-898f-a5b968ffa4f5'}, {'abstract': 'First day in Monaco and some memories of the past are drummed up, along with a little chaos in the paddock.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/25/first-day-in-monaco-sunshine-and-shadows/', 'snippet': 'First day in Monaco and some memories of the past are drummed up, along with a little chaos in the paddock.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONACO – I have never arrived in the paddock in Monaco and found it in such a state of construction before. No big deal for me, as the media can still get the job done. But the team members who have been going without sleep for 60 hours — as one said to me — really have it hard. All the time I was sleeping and writing my previews in the comfort of the trains from Barcelona to Monaco, these people were deconstructing, transporting and reconstructing the massive motor homes between the Barcelona paddock on Sunday to here today.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'First Day in Monaco, Sunshine and Shadows', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Monaco Grand Prix', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Button, Jenson', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumacher, Michael', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trulli, Jarno', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Formula One', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Monaco', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T01:30:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brad Spurgeon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Spurgeon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a00095d5-1050-5952-a8a2-0e24a74e9409', 'word_count': 485, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a00095d5-1050-5952-a8a2-0e24a74e9409'}, {'abstract': 'House members say American involvement violates a 60-day deadline.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/26/world/middleeast/26powers.html', 'snippet': 'House members say American involvement violates a 60-day deadline.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGT