time-payroll-projects-main-contractor-fires-a-manager.html', 'snippet': 'CityTime, a troubled New York payroll automation project, faced more scrutiny as the company overseeing it fired a senior employee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Doubts about CityTime, a troubled New York City payroll automation project, grew on Wednesday as the company overseeing the project said it had fired a senior employee for misrepresenting the number of hours he had worked.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Company Overseeing Payroll Project Fires Manager', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Company Overseeing Payroll Project Fires Manager', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SAIC Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suspensions, Dismissals and Resignations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T02:03:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Javier C. Hernández', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Javier', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Hernández', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/de92b0d1-37eb-5d46-b947-8e68371fe38a', 'word_count': 454, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de92b0d1-37eb-5d46-b947-8e68371fe38a'}, {'abstract': 'Two months ago, Eric Abidal was wondering whether he would play for Barcelona again. Now he’s wondering how much he’ll play in Saturday’s Champions League final.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/25/abidal-to-barcelonas-delight-is-ready-to-go/', 'snippet': 'Two months ago, Eric Abidal was wondering whether he would play for Barcelona again. Now he’s wondering how much he’ll play in Saturday’s Champions League final.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two months ago, Eric Abidal was wondering whether he would play for Barcelona again. Now he’s wondering how much he’ll play in Saturday’s Champions League final.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Abidal, to Barcelona’s Delight, Is Ready to Go', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abidal, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'FC Barcelona', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T02:04:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Das', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Das', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/49ed0ce2-5306-55d3-ae1c-30f51a6ad4e0', 'word_count': 539, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49ed0ce2-5306-55d3-ae1c-30f51a6ad4e0'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the use and effectiveness of the crossover move in basketball.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2011/05/26/sports/basketball/26crossover-graphic.html', 'snippet': 'A look at the use and effectiveness of the crossover move in basketball.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A look at the use and effectiveness of the crossover move in basketball.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/04/21/sports/crossover-promo/crossover-promo-jumbo.png', 'height': 164, 'width': 304, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/04/21/sports/crossover-promo/crossover-promo-su