 alcohol, guns and tobacco companies to “upcycle” their waste?', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/26/partnering-with-companies-that-sell-alcohol-guns-and-tobacco/', 'snippet': 'TerraCycle operates collection programs in 60 percent of America’s schools. Does that mean it shouldn’t work with alcohol, guns and tobacco companies to “upcycle” their waste?', 'lead_paragraph': 'A few years ago we were approached by Nomacorc, leaders in the production of synthetic wine corks, to run a “cork brigade.” We needed millions of corks at the time to create a cork board product that Office Max was ordering from us, and we concluded that wine, as controlled vices go, is rather innocuous. In the end, there wasn’t much internal debate, so we partnered rather quickly with the alcohol industry.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Partnering With Companies That Sell Alcohol, Guns and Tobacco', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cork', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recycling of Waste Materials', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TerraCycle', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T11:00:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Szaky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Szaky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d33d53c-07b7-5a51-a9a8-f426a0db4238', 'word_count': 650, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d33d53c-07b7-5a51-a9a8-f426a0db4238'}, {'abstract': 'After 15 years, Ratko Mladic, the former Bosnian Serb general accused of ordering the massacre of Muslims in 1995, was captured. He will be sent to The Hague for trial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/world/europe/27ratko-mladic.html', 'snippet': 'After 15 years, Ratko Mladic, the former Bosnian Serb general accused of ordering the massacre of Muslims in 1995, was captured. He will be sent to The Hague for trial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ratko Mladic, the former Bosnian Serb general held responsible for the massacre of some 8,000 Muslim men and boys at Srebrenica in 1995, was arrested on Thursday, signaling Serbia’s intention of finally escaping the isolation it brought on itself during the Balkan wars, the bloodiest in Europe since World War II.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/world/jp-27mladic/jp-27mladic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/27/world/jp-27mladic/jp-27mladic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/world/jp-27mladic/jp-27mladic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/world/jp-27mladic/jp-27mladic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/27/world/jp-27mladic/jp-27mladic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Serbia Says Jailed Mladic Will Face War Crimes Trial', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Serb Ex-General Accused of Massacre Is Captured', 'name': None, 'seo': No