y-falls-early-in-french-open-again/', 'snippet': 'Sam Querrey again lost early at the French Open, this time dropping a second-round match to Ivan Ljubicic on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS – Sam Querrey has been down this road before.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Querrey Falls Early in French Open, Again', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ljubicic, Ivan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Querrey, Sam', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T13:21:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/534fd6d8-b4d5-52a4-92b6-29ac05a09eb5', 'word_count': 371, 'uri': 'nyt://article/534fd6d8-b4d5-52a4-92b6-29ac05a09eb5'}, {'abstract': 'Indonesia is fast becoming a darling of financial markets, but as the attention on the country grows, so does the focus on flaws that, according to analysts, may restrict future growth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/business/global/27rupiah.html', 'snippet': 'Indonesia is fast becoming a darling of financial markets, but as the attention on the country grows, so does the focus on flaws that, according to analysts, may restrict future growth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JAKARTA — For a lesson in the promise and pitfalls of Indonesia’s economic resurgence, hours stuck in traffic on Jalan H. R. Rasuna Said, one of the main thoroughfares here, is as good a start as any. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source'