 your suggestions on our office wall. It is, however, not all that practical. If we ceased to use all the words that readers don’t want us to use, we might publish a blank magazine. Some of your explanations were erudite. Others were downright funny. We know one thing: We will never use impact as a verb ever again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Words You Don’t Say', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T16:22:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Nolan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nolan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ebd26a8-8626-5eac-be12-dfddde376eca', 'word_count': 1410, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ebd26a8-8626-5eac-be12-dfddde376eca'}, {'abstract': 'NYT: Front Page for 05/26/2011', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/podcast/2011/05/26/topnews/26frontpage.html', 'snippet': 'NYT: Front Page for 05/26/2011', 'lead_paragraph': 'NYT: Front Page for 05/26/2011', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NYT: Front Page for 05/26/2011', 'kicker': 'New York Times Front Page', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T16:24:33+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/f75774f2-5ad0-5916-b9ad-5accf4d514a5', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/f75774f2-5ad0-5916-b9ad-5accf4d514a5'}, {'abstract': 'The 10th season of “American Idol” sharpened its focus on the commercial viability of its contestants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/arts/television/american-idol-completes-its-10th-season.html', 'snippet': 'The 10th season of “American Idol” sharpened its focus on the commercial viability of its contestants.', 'lead_paragraph': '“American Idol” is becoming a bit like the Miss America pageant, bestowing a ceremonial title that’s coveted, if not of much use once obtained. On Wednesday night the 17-year-old country singer Scotty McCreery was crowned the winner of the show’s 10th season, having defeated the 16-year-old country singer Lauren Alaina. Nice — now the real work begins.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/Idol/Idol-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/Idol/Idol-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/Idol/Idol-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 877, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/Idol/Idol-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/Idol/Idol-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The ‘Idol’ Season: Sharper, and More Stars', 'kicker': "Critic's Notebook", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Savviness And Stars Lift ‘Idol’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCreery, Scotty', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T16:24