 at Bohemian National Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/arts/music/talea-ensemble-performs-at-bohemian-national-hall-review.html', 'snippet': 'The Talea Ensemble offered a program of striking works by the Austrian composer Olga Neuwirth at Bohemian National Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During an onstage interview midway through a concert by the Talea Ensemble at the Bohemian National Hall on the Upper East Side on Tuesday night, the Austrian composer Olga Neuwirth fielded a query about her sideline as an experimental filmmaker. “I want to look behind the curtains,” she said of that activity. “I want to go beyond the boundaries. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/ensemble/ensemble-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/ensemble/ensemble-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/ensemble/ensemble-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 573, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/ensemble/ensemble-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/27/arts/ensemble/ensemble-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking Behind Curtains on a Gripping Journey', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Looking Behind Curtains On a Gripping Journey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Talea Ensemble', 'ran