iew the building as well as the borrower, examining its finances over several years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/realestate/a-guide-for-the-co-op-neophyte-mortgages.html', 'snippet': 'Plenty of lenders are comfortable with co-ops; all will review the building as well as the borrower, examining its finances over several years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANY out-of-towner able to handle the shock of New York City real estate prices must prepare to absorb another anomaly: especially in Manhattan, that money buys a different type of home than it does anywhere else in the country, and that will affect financing.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/26/realestate/mort-graphic/mort-graphic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/26/realestate/mort-graphic/mort-graphic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/26/realestate/mort-graphic/mort-graphic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/26/realestate/mort-graphic/mort-graphic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Guide for the Co-op Neophyte', 'kicker': 'Mortgages', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Guide for the Co-op Neophyte', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Housing and Real Estate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-26T21:46:55+0000', 'document_type': 'articl