ng, and its growing signs of resilience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/world/middleeast/27syria.html', 'snippet': 'Shifting tactics show the evolution of a nine-week uprising, and its growing signs of resilience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — In a shift in strategy, protesters across Syria have moved their daily demonstrations against the government of President Bashar al-Assad to the evening, in the expectation that security forces will be more reluctant to shoot at them and have a more difficult time identifying them for arrest, activists and organizers said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In New Tack, Syrians Protest at Night to Elude Forces', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In New Tack, Syrians Protest at Night to Elude Forces', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T00:54:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nada Bakri', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nada', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakri', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8124d4ef-4498-5824-a7c2-84227f09a667', 'word_count': 839, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8124d4ef-4498-5824-a7c2-84227f09a667'}, {'abstract': 'Paul Ryan has experienced quite a comedown since a Democrat won Tuesday’s election in New York’s 26th Congressional District.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/opinion/27krugman.html', 'snippet': 'Paul Ryan has experienced quite a comedown since a Democrat won Tuesday’s election in New York’s 26th Congressional District.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yes, Paul Ryan, the chairman of the House Budget Committee, is a sore loser. Why do you ask?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-articleLarge.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-jumbo.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/02/opinion/paul-krugman/paul-krugman-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Medicare and Mediscares', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Columnist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Medicare And Mediscares', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': Non