rticle/a83f52f2-0a3b-5c96-8bd5-2425fc5e9aab'}, {'abstract': 'Lance Armstrong, who is under federal investigation, hired two prominent lawyers who had success against the government in a case relating to doping in baseball.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/sports/cycling/armstrong-strengthens-legal-team-for-inquiry.html', 'snippet': 'Lance Armstrong, who is under federal investigation, hired two prominent lawyers who had success against the government in a case relating to doping in baseball.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To combat what his supporters call information leaks that have compromised the criminal investigation into his cycling career, Lance Armstrong this week hired two prominent lawyers who have had success against the government in a case relating to doping.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Armstrong Strengthens Legal Team for Inquiry', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Armstrong Strengthens Legal Team For Inquiry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARMSTRONG, LANCE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peters, Elliot', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keker, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Keker & Van Nest', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T01:05:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Cycling', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Macur', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macur', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/00b44036-e7a8-5872-b5aa-de1ebe806a36', 'word_count': 405, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00b44036-e7a8-5872-b5aa-de1ebe806a36'}, {'abstract': 'More drift and recriminations are surely ahead unless President Obama comes up with a way to get the parties into serious talks. A September deadline is looming.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/opinion/27fri1.html', 'snippet': 'More drift and recriminations are surely ahead unless President Obama comes up with a way to get the parties into serious talks. A September deadline is looming.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is the time for bold ideas to salvage Israeli-Palestinian peace efforts. Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel did not seize it. In his address to Congress, he showed — once again — that he has no serious appetite for the kind of compromises that are the only way to forge a two-state solution and guarantee both Palestinians their long-denied state and Israel’s long-term security.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mideast Peace Process: No Plan for Talks', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Sorry State of the Peace Process: No plan to get Israelis and Palestinians back to the table', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABBAS, MAHMOUD', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T01:05:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/8da9ebaf-68a7-5f2d-a84c-70e674032f77', 'word_count': 579, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8da9ebaf-68a7-5f2d-a84c-70e674032f77'}, {'abstract': 'Trevor Bayne, 20, won the Daytona 500 this year but has not raced since April 23 because of an undetermined illness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/sports/autoracing/mysterious-illness-slows-trevor-bayne-up-and-coming-driver.html', 'snippet': 'Trevor Bayne, 20, won the Daytona 500 this year but has not raced since April 23 because of an undetermined illness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. — From mastery to mystery, no Nascar driver has taken more dramatic turns this season than Trevor Bayne.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mysterious Illness Slows Up-and-Coming Driver', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mysterious Illness Slows Up-and-Coming Driver', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Daytona 500 (Auto Race)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bayne, Trevor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T01:09:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Auto Racing', 'byline': {'original': 'By Viv Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Viv', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d29bf57-7565-5f79-b2d1-2a1d6f351da4', 'word_count': 795, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d29bf57-7565-5f79-b2d1-2a1d6f351da4'}, {'abstract': 'Facebook is in talks with music services to make a tab to display a user’s top songs and to give friends an easy way to hear them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/technology/27facebook.html', 'snippet': 'Facebook is in t