icle/d420052e-c0ef-5654-843b-335d891c12fc'}, {'abstract': 'The $39 billion sale would result in more consolidation “than any previous merger” in the wireless communications market, said one congressman.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/business/27telecom.html', 'snippet': 'The $39 billion sale would result in more consolidation “than any previous merger” in the wireless communications market, said one congressman.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Members of Congress expressed concern Thursday that AT&T’s planned purchase of T-Mobile USA might thwart competition and raise prices for wireless users.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'AT&T’s Plan to Buy T-Mobile May Reduce Competition, Legislators Warn', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'AT&T’s Plan to Buy T-Mobile May Reduce Competition, Legislators Warn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AT&T Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'T-Mobile', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cellular Telephones', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T01:17:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bloomberg News', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bloomberg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'News', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e15d5a5e-6014-5305-8d53-1701e5c8035b', 'word_count': 256, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e15d5a5e-6014-5305-8d53-1701e5c8035b'}, {'abstract': 'After an unsatisfactory showing at the Iowa caucuses in 2008, Mitt Romney is weighing the question of how extensively he should campaign there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/us/politics/27romney.html', 'snippet': 'After an unsatisfactory showing at the Iowa caucuses in 2008, Mitt Romney is weighing the question of how extensively he should campaign there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'URBANDALE, Iowa — At this point four years ago, Mitt Romney’s television commercials had been running here for 13 weeks. His campaign headquarters, bustling with activity, provided one of the best jobs around for Republican operatives. He fought hard to win the Iowa Straw Poll, an early test of organizing, and he did.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/us/ROMNEY-1/ROMNEY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/27/us/ROMNEY-1/ROMNEY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/us/ROMNEY-1/ROMNEY-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/us/ROMNEY-1/ROMNEY-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/27/us/ROMNEY-1/ROMNEY-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'State of Uncertainty for Romney Camp as It Looks to Iowa', 'kicker': 'Political Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A State of Uncertainty For the Romney Camp As It Looks to Iowa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Part