omething unusually dishonest about the pandering for Jewish support.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Only a few minutes after President Obama finished his carefully balanced speech on the Middle East last week, Republican presidential candidates and lawmakers began twisting his words to suggest that he was calling for an epochal abandonment of Israel.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mideast Peace Process: Washington Makes Things Worse', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Sorry State of the Peace Process: Politicians in Washington are making things worse', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T01:30:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/1bf3e579-bf91-59f7-bc8e-c8857c80f304', 'word_count': 431, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1bf3e579-bf91-59f7-bc8e-c8857c80f304'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Chris Christie said the 10-state regional program had not had a discernible impact on the environment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/nyregion/christie-pulls-nj-from-greenhouse-gas-coalition.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Chris Christie said the 10-state regional program had not had a discernible impact on the environment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Chris Christie said Thursday that New Jersey would become the first state to withdraw from a 10-state trading system, the Regio