69f8', 'word_count': 189, 'uri': 'nyt://article/168566ce-023c-5e12-87e6-6e22f85469f8'}, {'abstract': 'Dwyane Wade and LeBron James scored all but 4 of Miami’s 26 points in the fourth quarter and combined for 17 points in a 19-4 run to finish the game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/sports/basketball/james-and-wade-lead-late-rally-as-heat-advances.html', 'snippet': 'Dwyane Wade and LeBron James scored all but 4 of Miami’s 26 points in the fourth quarter and combined for 17 points in a 19-4 run to finish the game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — There are perhaps a thousand ways to seize a conference title, but none more emphatic, more authoritative or more vehement than the method LeBron James chose Thursday night to send the Miami Heat to the N.B.A. finals.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/27/sports/27heat_337/27heat_337-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 892, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Heat Gains Finals as Stars Rally Late', 'kicker': 'Playoffs | Heat 83, Bulls 80', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'James and Wade Have Final Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Bulls', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wade, Dwyane', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T03:44:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Howard Beck', 'person': [{'firstname