y Administration has opened investigations into driver’s side air bags that may not deploy on Jeep Wranglers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '225,000 Jeep Wranglers Investigated for Potential Air-Bag Failure', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Safety Features and Defects', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jeep Division of Chrysler', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Highway Traffic Safety Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Saturn Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T14:59:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f499acc7-92f7-5c8c-a8ee-f51ca50e265b', 'word_count': 258, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f499acc7-92f7-5c8c-a8ee-f51ca50e265b'}, {'abstract': 'Nicholas Kirkwood’s graphic new shoe shop gives fashionistas yet another reason to prowl London’s tony Mount Street.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/pop-shop/', 'snippet': 'Nicholas Kirkwood’s graphic new shoe shop gives fashionistas yet another reason to prowl London’s tony Mount Street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As if there weren’t enough reasons for fashionistas to prowl London’s tony Mount Street, Nicholas Kirkwood’s graphic new shop features the shoe designer’s entire collection, including highly coveted collaborations with Rodarte, Erdem and Peter Pilotto, and a clutch of wildly creative cartoon-like confections inspired by the pop artist Keith Haring. 5 Mount Street; 011 44 207 499 5781; nicholaskirkwood.com.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pop Shop', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T15:00:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sandra Ballentine', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ballentine', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a24f3f13-23c6-5fd3-ac94-4f3631d276a9', 'word_count': 59, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a24f3f13-23c6-5fd3-ac94-4f3631d276a9'}, {'abstract': 'Jon Hamm, who plays Don Draper on the hit AMC period drama “Mad Men,” said he had been contemplating an opportunity to direct an episode of the show ever since John Slattery did so during the show’s fourth season.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/jon-hamm-to-direct-mad-men-season-premiere/', 'snippet': 'Jon Hamm, who plays Don Draper on the hit AMC period drama “Mad Men,” said he had been contemplating an opportunity to direct an episode of the show ever since John Slattery did so during the show’s fourth season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As if Don Draper didn’t have enough on his plate already, with a new marriage, a daughter who’s too grown up for her age, a son who’s constantly being replaced by new actors, a struggling ad agency whose future all but rests on his shoulders and all that smoking and drinking he has to do, another responsibility has been added to his plate for the coming season of “Mad Men.” Jon Hamm, the actor who plays Draper on that hit AMC period drama, will direct the first episode of the show’s new season, the Web site tvline.com reported.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jon Hamm to Direct ‘Mad Men’ Season Premiere', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T15:04:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d221f42b-e258-51b2-a5cb-d21c2e09c4f8', 'word_count': 278, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d221f42b-e258-51b2-a5cb-d21c2e09c4f8'}, {'abstract': 'Mark Bittman makes pan-seared, spice-rubbed salmon, a recipe from the Minimalist archives.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/fashion/100000000773814/salmon-rub.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Bittman makes pan-seared, spice-rubbed salmon, a recipe from the Minimalist archives.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mark Bittman makes pan-seared, spice-rubbed salmon, a recipe from the Minimalist archives.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13COOKING-4SPICE-SALMON1/13COOKING-4SPICE-SALMON1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13COOKING-4SPICE-SALMON1/13COOKING-4SPICE-SALMON1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/12/13/dining/13COOKING-4SPICE-SALMON1/13COOKING-4SPICE-SALMON1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'capt