.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/summer-2011-on-the-learning-network/', 'snippet': 'Our daily lesson plans will be on hiatus until Labor Day, but there’s still plenty to do on The Learning Network this summer, including a July student reading challenge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As we did last year, we’ll suspend daily lessons this summer from Memorial Day through Labor Day. But don’t worry: there will still be plenty to do. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Summer 2011 on The Learning Network', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T17:09:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katherine Schulten', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schulten', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b90ebd6-f9c9-5fab-ace1-862d3c8911a8', 'word_count': 495, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b90ebd6-f9c9-5fab-ace1-862d3c8911a8'}, {'abstract': 'The town, glamorous since the 1920s, now resembles an upscale Southern California shopping center, some say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/fashion/beverly-hills-still-elite-but.html', 'snippet': 'The town, glamorous since the 1920s, now resembles an upscale Southern California shopping center, some say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEVERLY HILLS, Calif.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/fashion/BEVERLY2/BEVERLY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/29/fashion/BEVERLY2/BEVERLY2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 