al in London, our friend Deroy Peraza at the Hyperakt design boutique has taken a graphic look at the final.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/champions-league-final-graphically-speaking/', 'snippet': 'Just in time for Saturday’s Champions League final in London, our friend Deroy Peraza at the Hyperakt design boutique has taken a graphic look at the final.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Saturday brings the “dream final” in what some people like to call a “massive game,” perhaps the two best teams in the world — Manchester United and Barcelona — on the verdant grass of Wembley Stadium in London. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Champions League Final … Graphically Speaking', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hyperakt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T17:49:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6f7f4be6-c29e-5846-8357-eb9fee3aa924', 'word_count': 95, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f7f4be6-c29e-5846-8357-eb9fee3aa924'}, {'abstract': 'Women are buying more wine, so winemakers are coming up with labels aimed at attracting young mothers and cupcake lovers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/fashion/wines-targeted-at-women.html', 'snippet': 'Women are buying more wine, so winemakers are coming up with labels aimed at attracting young mothers and cupcake lovers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN “Sex and the City” ended its run in 2004 as one of HBO’s most successful series, seemingly every network tried to recapture the show’s lighthearted, feminine formula.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_