ogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/foxs-fresh-fare-a-winner-as-rerun-season-begins/', 'snippet': 'The season premiere of “So You Think You Can Dance” draws 9.1 million viewers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As summer repeats arrived on Thursday night for much of network television, the lone exception led the evening as 9.1 million viewers tuned in to Fox’s eighth-season premiere of “So You Think You Can Dance,” according to Nielsen’s estimates. Although technically tied with CBS’s rerun of “The Mentalist” at 10, and excluding cable ratings for TNT’s coverage of the N.B.A. playoffs, the two-hour premiere lifted Fox to No. 1 on the night among the four main television networks while attracting the series’ largest audience for the start of a season in four years. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fox’s Fresh Fare a Winner as Rerun Season Begins', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nielsen Media Research', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Turner Network Television', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T18:44:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Toff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Toff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News