enstein, vampires and a love child.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SWITZERLAND is rarely thought of as a wild artistic center. Most of us recall the harsh verdict of Harry Lime, the character played by Orson Welles in “The Third Man,” who declared that the country’s most creative achievement was the cuckoo clock.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/travel/29cover-span/29cover-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 179, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/29/travel/29cover-span/29cover-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 179}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/travel/29cover-span/29cover-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 306, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/travel/29cover-span/29cover-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/29/travel/29cover-span/29cover-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lake Geneva as Shelley and Byron Knew It', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shores of Romance and Scandal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Switzerland', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shelley, Percy Bysshe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lausanne (Switzerland)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Byron, Lord', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name'