 the vast range of our readers’ experiences.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/travel/why-we-travel-readers-share-their-stories.html', 'snippet': 'In April, we asked readers to submit essays of their own to answer “Why We Travel.” Here are four that illustrate the vast range of our readers’ experiences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ON April 3, inspired by the essay by Paul Theroux titled “Why We Travel,” we asked readers to submit essays of their own to answer this question. Several hundred responded, relating stories that took us from the mountains of Peru to the halls of Rome. On May 1 we published three. Here are four more that illustrate the vast range of our readers’ experiences. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why We Travel: Readers Share Their Stories', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Readers: Why We Travel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indonesia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cairo (Egypt)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chennai (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T18:55:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editors', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editors'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02c57286-c9c6-542f-bb8c-78fd56eb570f', 'word_count': 1324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02c57286-c9c6-542f-bb8c-78fd56eb570f'}, {'abstract': 'Readers share ways to save on gas this summer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/travel/letters-saving-on-gas.html', 'snippet': 'Readers share ways to save on gas this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor: Regarding “13 Ways to Save on Gas This Summer” (Practical Traveler, May 15): Save money overall by not buying a huge SUV that you use in everyday life to drive a few people a mile here or there, because you really want to make sure you have that huge SUV for your family road trip. Rent one for the road trip if it is necessary instead, and you’ll save on gas the rest of the year. I also recommend keeping track of traffic patterns. I just drove through the night 800 miles one way and, during the day, back home (another 800 miles). The night trip was much, much faster because of the lack of traffic and fewer stops for gas.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Letters: Saving on Gas', 'kicker': 'Letters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Saving on Gas', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T18:55:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/e9c39744-fbb2-5ab7-836b-346ba84fa177', 'word_count': 292, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9c39744-fbb2-5ab7-836b-346ba84fa177'}, {'abstract': 'In Kakheti, booming agritourism ventures offer a chance to see how private farming has revived since the end of Communism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/05/29/travel/20110529journeys-georgia.html', 'snippet': 'In Kakheti, booming agritourism ventures offer a chance to see how private farming has revived since the end of Communism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Kakheti, booming agritourism ventures offer a chance to see how private farming has revived since the end of Communism.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/travel/20110529TOURISM-slide-FUN5/20110529TOURISM-slide-FUN5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 