saki Ninja 250R has been around since 1986, and with regular updates it has long been a favorite of smaller riders, women and students in safety courses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/automobiles/29NINJA.html', 'snippet': 'The Kawasaki Ninja 250R has been around since 1986, and with regular updates it has long been a favorite of smaller riders, women and students in safety courses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE 250cc sportbike class is a small group, but the Honda CBR250R is not its only admirable member. The Kawasaki Ninja 250R has been around since 1986, and with regular updates through the years it has long been a favorite of smaller riders, women and students in Motorcycle Safety Foundation RiderCourses.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/automobiles/NINJ/NINJ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/automobiles/NINJ/NINJ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/29/automobiles/NINJ/NINJ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Classmate Feels the Pressure', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Classmate Feels the Pressure', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Honda Motor Co Ltd', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Motorcycles, Motor Bikes and Motorscooters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T20:34:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Automobiles', 'section_name': 'Automobiles