orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Biography', '_id': 'nyt://article/19ff1ae9-6c8e-533a-919f-5feaf7c235a4', 'word_count': 1259, 'uri': 'nyt://article/19ff1ae9-6c8e-533a-919f-5feaf7c235a4'}, {'abstract': 'Bryan Denton has distinguished himself in Libya, C. J. Chivers reports. And Mr. Denton shares that story in his own words.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/27/a-towering-perspective-on-libya/', 'snippet': 'Bryan Denton has distinguished himself in Libya, C. J. Chivers reports. And Mr. Denton shares that story in his own words.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first thing people tend to notice about Bryan Denton is that he is tall — very tall. There’s a reason for mentioning this, and we’ll get back to it before long. First, let’s talk about about Bryan and his work, and the year he is having.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Towering Perspective on Libya', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Denton, Bryan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chivers, C J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Libya', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Misurata (Libya)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-27T21:30:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By C. J. Chivers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'C.', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Chivers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/787c1bb1-a967-5ecf-8c33-58a1137d8a49', 'word_count': 4288, 'uri': 'nyt://article/787c1bb1-a967-5ecf-8c33-58a1137d8a49'}, {'abstract': 'After placing a