ohn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Markoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/11b1d1b9-5b47-594e-9767-b5cc466a4634', 'word_count': 886, 'uri': 'nyt://article/11b1d1b9-5b47-594e-9767-b5cc466a4634'}, {'abstract': 'The 7-foot-2 former star, who led the league in blocks nine times, was the No. 1 draft pick in 1998 and the tallest player in the W.N.B.A.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/28/sports/margo-dydek-37-towering-womens-basketball-center.html', 'snippet': 'The 7-foot-2 former star, who led the league in blocks nine times, was the No. 1 draft pick in 1998 and the tallest player in the W.N.B.A.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Margo Dydek, the 7-foot-2 Polish center who was the W.N.B.A.’s No. 1 draft pick in 1998 and went on to become its leading career shot blocker, died on Friday in Brisbane, Australia. She was 37.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/28/sports/DYDEK-obit/DYDEK-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/28/sports/DYDEK-obit/DYDEK-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/28/sports/DYDEK-obit/DYDEK-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Margo Dydek, Towering Women’s Basketball Center, Dies at 37', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Margo Dydek, 37, Towering Women’s Basketball Center', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Women's National Basketball Assn", 'rank': 1