est was the leader of the engineering team portrayed in Tracy Kidder’s book, “The Soul of a New Machine.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tom West, a shy computer engineer who became an unlikely symbol of\xa0high tech\xa0to\xa0multitudes\xa0of general-interest readers as leader of the engineering team portrayed in Tracy Kidder’s book “The Soul of a New Machine,” died on May 19 at his home in Westport, Mass. He was 71.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/28/business/WEST-obit/WEST-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/28/business/WEST-obit/WEST-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/28/business/WEST-obit/WEST-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tom West Dies at 71; Was the Computer Engineer Incarnate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tom West, 71; Was the Computer Engineer Incarnate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'West, Tom', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Data General', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Engineering and Engineers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-28T01:25:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Vitello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vitello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/db5dec80-d840-50ef-a7a3-92a26757d872', 'word_count': 767, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db5dec80-d840-50ef-a7a3-92a26757d872'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Rutt’s video animation system helped propel the video-art revolution of the 1970s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/arts/steve-rutt-an-inventor-behind-early-video-animation-dies-at-66.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Rutt’s video animation system helped propel the video-art revolution of the 1970s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steve Rutt, an engineer, inventor and artist whose early video animation system made images expand and contract and leap and dance, and in so doing helped propel the video-art revolution of the 1970s, died on May 20 in Manhattan. He was 66.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/arts/dogRUTT-obit/dogRUTT-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/arts/dogRUTT-obit/dogRUTT-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/29/arts/dogRUTT-obit/dogRUTT-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Steve Rutt, an Inventor Behind Early Video Animation, Dies at 66', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Steve Rutt, 66, an Inventor Behind Early Video Animation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recordings and Downloads (Video)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major'