011/05/29/sports/baseball/joe-torre-and-baseball-putting-the-focus-on-prostate-cancer.html', 'snippet': 'Joe Torre, the former manager of the Yankees, is spreading the news about his battle with prostate cancer, which strikes one in six men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Joe Torre was managing, he used to receive suggestions from fans about lineups and rotations and, most helpful of all, how to handle the Boss. As if.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/sports/Y-TORRE/Y-TORRE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 614, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/sports/Y-TORRE/Y-TORRE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/29/sports/Y-TORRE/Y-TORRE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Torre’s Gift to All Fathers: Frank Talk About Prostate Cancer', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Torre’s Gift to All Fathers: Frank Talk About Prostate Cancer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Torre, Joe', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prostate Cancer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-28T15:34:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By George Vecsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'George', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vecsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'orga