'uri': 'nyt://article/077b49b8-7c3d-5be6-bf16-af9e6155c914'}, {'abstract': 'Wheels will return to our regular coverage on Tuesday, May 31.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/28/have-an-enjoyable-memorial-day-weekend/', 'snippet': 'Wheels will return to our regular coverage on Tuesday, May 31.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wheels will be taking a short break in observance of Memorial Day, but we’ll return on Tuesday, May 31, with our regular coverage. Whatever mode of transport conveys you to your destination, the editors and contributors at Wheels wish you safe and happy travels this holiday weekend.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Have an Enjoyable Memorial Day Weekend', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-28T16:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/16dd3507-1776-5741-9da2-15e05ea00921', 'word_count': 47, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16dd3507-1776-5741-9da2-15e05ea00921'}, {'abstract': 'Novak Djokovic defeated Juan Martín Del Potro when their suspended match at Roland Garros resumed on Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/sports/tennis/djokovic-streak-hits-42-as-he-beats-del-potro-in-french-open.html', 'snippet': 'Novak Djokovic defeated Juan Martín Del Potro when their suspended match at Roland Garros resumed on Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Best of three. Best of five. Darkness. Daylight. Delays. Resumptions. Italian clay. French clay. None of it has affected the bottom line for Novak Djokovic in 2011. He remains unbeatable, or more to the point, undefeated.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'ca