times.com/2011/05/29/sports/basketball/spoelstra-has-heat-right-where-it-wanted-to-be.html', 'snippet': 'Heat Coach Erik Spoelstra had to survive a season in which any misstep would be magnified, considering the high-profile players he was coaching.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Watson Spoelstra covered sports in Detroit during the middle of the last century. It was another era, another world. There were no computers, just typewriters. Reporters traveled with teams and inevitably became close with some of the players they wrote about. They might even bail a player out of jail, as Spoelstra once did for the Detroit Lions’ Bobby Layne. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/sports/spoelstra1/spoelstra1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 845, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/sports/spoelstra1/spoelstra1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/29/sports/spoelstra1/spoelstra1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Spoelstra Raised to Be in N.B.A., and Rising to Challenge', 'kicker': 'Finals', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spoelstra Raised to Be in N.B.A., and Rising to Challenge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spoelstra, Erik', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons',