NATO Meeting, Killing Police Official and Others', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taliban Bomber Infiltrates Afghan-NATO Meeting, Killing Police Official and Others', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-28T16:41:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ray Rivera', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ray', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rivera', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b44a9b76-8a15-5c50-aef0-a2ed6112325e', 'word_count': 895, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b44a9b76-8a15-5c50-aef0-a2ed6112325e'}, {'abstract': 'In South Florida police impersonators have become better organized and, most troubling to law enforcement officials, more violent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/us/29fakecops.html', 'snippet': 'In South Florida police impersonators have become better organized and, most troubling to law enforcement officials, more violent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — A black BMW flashing red and blue lights suddenly filled Alexandria Armeley’s rearview mirror one evening last month. At a stoplight, the BMW’s driver pulled up next to her, waved a gold badge and told her “I’m a cop.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/u