f-ritual/', 'snippet': 'Stoic N.H.L. players have been know to skate on through the pain, as did several members of the San Jose Sharks last week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the most celebrated aspects of Stanley Cup play is the pain players endure to make a contribution during the postseason. It is a point of professional pride that hockey players will dress for games with injuries that would sideline most other athletes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Playing Through Pain Is a Playoff Ritual', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Jose Sharks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vancouver Canucks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-28T18:08:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein and Stu Hackel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Stu', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hackel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fadb9ed2-5e6e-5aa8-a9e5-2abfff4205ae', 'word_count': 771, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fadb9ed2-5e6e-5aa8-a9e5-2abfff4205ae'}, {'abstract': 'Dismay in France over what many view as rough treatment is rooted in an unfamiliarity with an American justice system that differs profoundly from the French model.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/world/europe/29france.html', 'snippet': 'Dismay in France over what many view as rough treatment is rooted in an unfamiliarity with an American justice system that differs profoundly from the French model.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The sexual assault case against Dominique Strauss-Kahn, which continues to crowd out much other news here, is becoming something of a civics lesson in American justice — one that has inspired both biting criticism and some respect.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'French System Tints View of the Strauss-Kahn Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'French System Tints View Of the Strauss-Kahn Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strauss-Kahn, Dominique', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-28T18:09:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Sayare', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sayare', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9786b429-aae9-51ba-a6da-91e3baed191e', 'word_count': 644, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9786b429-aae9-51ba-a6da-91e3baed191e'}, {'abstract': 'Google, Facebook and Netflix track users’ habits and tailor future results to show people what they want to see. Affirmation feels good, but it may not be constructive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/technology/29stream.html', 'snippet': 'Google, Facebook and Netflix track users’ habits and tailor future results to show people what they want to see. Affirmation feels good, but it may not be constructive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ON the Web, we often see what we like, and like what we see. Whether we know it or not, the Internet creates personalized e-comfort zones for each one of us. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/business/STREAM/STREAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/05/29/business/STREAM/STREAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/business/STREAM/STREAM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/business/STREAM/STREAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/29/business/STREAM/STREAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Trouble With the Echo Chamber Online', 'kicker': 'Slipstream', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Trouble With the Echo Chamber Online', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search Engines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook.com', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-28T18:12:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'B