h.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/28/tornado-losses-in-2011-already-match-deadliest-year/', 'snippet': 'This year’s tornado season is one of the deadliest on record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The federal Storm Prediction Center has released its latest\xa0tally of tornadoes and deaths for 2011, with the current count of\xa0523 now making this the worst year since 1950.. [May 30, 11:45 p.m. | Updated  This line and the headline have been adjusted to eliminate an error explained at the end of this post.]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tornado Losses in 2011 Worst Since 1950', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-05-28T21:56:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/725c3bc0-2f75-53b8-b807-53df2c926026', 'word_count': 181, 'uri': 'nyt://article/725c3bc0-2f75-53b8-b807-53df2c926026'}, {'abstract': 'A response to an article about the value of male clients working with male therapists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/opinion/lweb29therapy.html', 'snippet': 'A response to an article about the value of male clients working with male therapists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gender and Therapists', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gender and Therapists', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychology and Psychologists', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men