rson': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c54fde3-2dbd-5126-8e5d-2a3886ad1081', 'word_count': 741, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c54fde3-2dbd-5126-8e5d-2a3886ad1081'}, {'abstract': 'In showing caution with R.A. Dickey’s minor foot injury, the Mets may be displaying a shift in their approach to the health of their players.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/29/sports/baseball/dickey-is-willing-but-mets-want-to-be-sure-hes-able.html', 'snippet': 'In showing caution with R.A. Dickey’s minor foot injury, the Mets may be displaying a shift in their approach to the health of their players.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With their recent history of trying to rush players back from injuries or attempting to hide the exact nature of injuries, it would seem imprudent for the Mets to allow R. A. Dickey to make his next start if there is any chance he is unfit, or unable to perform all his duties. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/sports/Y-METSNOTES/Y-METSNOTES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 837, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/05/29/sports/Y-METSNOTES/Y-METSNOTES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/05/29/sports/Y-METSNOTES/Y-METSNOTES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dickey Is Willing, but the Mets Want to Be Sure He Is Able', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dickey Is Willing, but the Mets Want to Be Sure He Is Abl