7d89d903964'}, {'abstract': 'The death of a toddler whose remains were found on Long Island is probably unconnected to the killings of several prostitutes whose bodies were left nearby.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/30/nyregion/among-bodies-discarded-on-a-beach-one-that-doesnt-fit.html', 'snippet': 'The death of a toddler whose remains were found on Long Island is probably unconnected to the killings of several prostitutes whose bodies were left nearby.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The little girl had lived, at most, 730 days or so. Someone had hidden her body in the thicket of branches and poison ivy off Ocean Parkway on the South Shore of Long Island. By the time the police discovered her on April 4, the remains had turned skeletal. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Among Bodies Discarded on a Beach, One That Doesn’t Fit', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Whose Child Was This? Among Bodies Discarded on a Beach, One That Doesn’t Fit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Serial Murders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Youth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-30T01:06:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manny Fernandez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fernandez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53741048-b463-59b4-92cd-01754e734baf', 'word_count': 1086, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53741048-b463-59b4-92cd-01754e734baf'}, {'abstract': 'Crystal Melody Sweet, 22, and Timothy Walter were shot to death around 5 a.m., the police said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/30/nyregion/shooting-in-a-sheepshead-bay-courtyard.html', 'snippet': 'Crystal Melody Sweet, 22, and Timothy Walter were shot to death around 5 a.m., the police said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A man and a woman were killed and another man was wounded in a shooting early Sunday morning in a courtyard of a Brooklyn housing project, the police said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Man and Woman Killed at Brooklyn Housing Project', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man and Woman Killed at Brooklyn Housing Project', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Watson, Timothy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'SHEEPSHEAD BAY (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-30T01:07:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Stelloh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelloh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/24edeb88-1ea9-5a94-816b-b42f91945d97', 'word_count': 324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/24edeb88-1ea9-5a94-816b-b42f91945d97'}, {'abstract': 'A new Supreme Court threat to “the supreme Law of the Land.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/05/30/opinion/30mon1.html', 'snippet': 'A new Supreme Court threat to “the supreme Law of the Land.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chief Justice John Roberts is one vote short of moving the Supreme Court to a position so conservative on states’ rights that it would be to the right of the Tea Party’s idea of limited government. That chilling possibility was evident in the court’s recent ruling in the case of Virginia v. Stewar