beat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/31/venice-biennale-up-the-canal-without-a-water-bus/', 'snippet': 'A one-day strike puts a crimp in Biennale activities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VENICE — The weather may be picture-perfect, but the stars were not all aligned for the first day the giant Biennale was open to the art press and V.I.P.’s. A one-day water-bus strike has crippled this shimmering city. When asked the reason for the walkout, a concierge at the chic Hotel Danieli, shrugged and replied, “Money, madame,’’ like everywhere else.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Venice Biennale: Up the Canal Without a Water Bus', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Strikes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Venice Biennale', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venice (Italy)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-31T14:27:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/965c6749-fc09-56b3-bcf9-accfd1537ad2', 'word_count': 179, 'uri': 'nyt://article/965c6749-fc09-56b3-bcf9-accfd1537ad2'}, {'abstract': 'The ‘Top Gear’ co-host warmed up the Sunday crowds at Indianapolis Motor Speedway with a record-setting truck leap.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/05/31/tanner-foust-soars-332-feet-to-set-record-at-indy-500/', 'snippet': 'The ‘Top Gear’ co-host warmed up the Sunday crowds at Indianapolis Motor Speedway with a record-setting truck leap.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INDIANAPOLIS — As race fans trickled in to