e choice but to re-elect a president weakened by a corruption scandal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/01/sports/soccer/status-quo-running-unopposed-in-fifa-election.html', 'snippet': 'FIFA’s leaders gathered in Zurich with little choice but to re-elect a president weakened by a corruption scandal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ZURICH — Just as buses full of soccer’s top officials pulled up for the start of FIFA’s much-anticipated meetings Tuesday, it started to rain. And then it poured. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Status Quo Unopposed in FIFA’s Election', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Status Quo Unopposed In FIFA Election', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Hammam, Mohamed', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blatter, Sepp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Federation of Association Football (FIFA)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Cup (Soccer)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-05-31T23:50:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Branch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Branch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bebeb8f2-2ba8-5802-8eb8-e2e81a89f9c6', 'word_count': 591, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bebeb8f2-2ba8-5802-8eb8-e2e81a89f9c6'}, {'abstract': 'New York City is on the verge of ending its signature program for homeless families, saying the generosity might have contributed to the problem.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/01/nyregion/new-york-city-close-to-ending-key-housing-program.html', 'snippet': 'New York City is on the verge of ending its signature program for homeless families, saying the generosity might have contributed to the problem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With New York City’s shelter population near all-time highs, the Bloomberg administration is on the verge of ending its signature housing program for homeless families, saying the program’s generosity might have contributed to the problem.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/01/nyregion/yjp-HOMELESS/yjp-HOMELESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/01/nyregion/yjp-HOMELESS/yjp-HOMELESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/01/nyregion/yjp-HOMELESS/yjp-HOMELESS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/01/nyregion/yjp-HOMELESS/yjp-HOMELESS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/01/nyregion/yjp-HOMELESS/yjp-HOMELESS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Clock Ticks for a Key Homeless Program', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'City Sees End To Rental Aid For Homeless', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Homeless Services Department (NYC